<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">JOSPOK.SFK 12-10-2007. Adelina Quej Xoy. Pocomchi. Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">JOSUE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jos</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOSUE</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I JOSUE</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOSUE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xsik'arik wach ruum i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq kamnaq chik i Moisés, re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'oreej i Josué rak'uun i Nun re' wo' hoq ixtowik cho reh i Moisés je' wili i xuq'or reh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' i Moisés waj kamanoom xkimik chik yu'naak re' chik i hat naa aaq'asaniik reje keh chu'nchel i aj Israel chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. Eh naa taq aq'ahxiik reje chupaam i ye'aab' okik weh chi ruye'ariik taq aweh i hat, hat taq aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' hin naa nuye'em taq aweh chu'nchel i ye'aab' naa taq aponiik wii', je' rukab' i xnuq'or reh i Moisés, noq xub'an. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq nuye'em aweh i ye'aab', naa rutohq'iik chaloq chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq', naa ruponiik paraxchee' Líbano, naa ruponiik chi chii' i nim ha' Éufrates, eh chu'nchel kiye'aab' i aj heteo, eh naa ruponiik ko chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hat Josué ma' awach ta naa ruq'atwiik awach nik' najtiil naa aak'achariik ruum re' hin naa nuwihiik awuuk' cha toob'jiik, ma' jaruuj naa kaat nukanaam cha wutkeel, je' rukab' noq xnutob'eej i Moisés. <verse number="6" style="v" />Je' re' noq chakowej awiib' cha chop ak'ux, ruum re' hat naa aach'aqwiik i ye'aab' keh i aj Israel i naa kichopom naah. Re' i ye'aab' nuq'orom chee xti korik keh aamaam awati't chi naa nuye'em keh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Xa re' i nupahqaaj aweh i hin chi chakowej awiib', eh cha chop ak'ux chi korik, eh cha a'n chu'nchel i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal xuq'or aweh i waj kamanoom Moisés. Maacanaa' rub'aan, maa t'ooj panasak'aaj, ni xata panatz'eet reh chi nee ti elik korik ruuk' chu'nchel i naa a'nam. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta akanaam ruq'orariik i nuk'uhb'aal, chi q'iij chi aq'ab' naa atijem riij i nuk'uhb'aal tz'ihb'amaj chupaam i huuj, reh chi neena a'n chi korik taqe i ruq'or. Chi je' re' nee ti elik korik, eh chu'nchel nee nelik korik chawach. <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin kinq'orik aweh chi chakowej awiib' cha chop ak'ux, mat yo'jik, eh marub'an kiib' ak'ux, ruum re' hin aaWaJaaw aaDios naa nuwihiik awuuk' chatoob'jiik xa aha' pa' nee tiooj, i nuchjik ruum i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xumol kiwach taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel, je' wili i xuq'or keh: <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ik'een taq chupaam taqe i itz'ihy naah paat cha q'or taq keh i wilkeeb' ar, chi kiyejaa' kiwa' kihaa', ruum panixib' q'iij inqaq'at reje wach i nim ha' Jordán, reh chi naa rojiik qachopom naah i ye'aab' naa ruye'em qeh i QaJaaw Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué xuq'oreej taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, je' wo' hoq i yejaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés, je' wili i xuq'or keh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mansahchik taq panak'ux i xuq'or taq aweh i Moisés chi naa taq a'nam re' raj kamanoom i QaJaaw, re' noq xuq'or chi je' wili: Re' taq aaWaJaaw aaDios naa ruye'em taq aweh i ye'aab' re' re', reh chi ar taq naa ahi'liik, inki. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' taq awehk'een, taqe aachikoop cha kanaa' taq ayu' chupaam i ye'aab' xuyeew taq kahnoq aweh i Moisés, chi juntar chee nim ha' Jordán. Eh re' taq i hat winaq i ko hat kow konee taq i nakuy i q'aq'inik cha chop taq atz'a'aamb'aal reh q'aq'inik hiy taq chi peet b'eeh chikiwach awuch aj Israel. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh korehtaal inye'arik i kiye'aab' ruum i QaJaaw Dios, je' rukab' noq xuyeew taq aye'aab' i hat. Eh korehtaal wo' inkehchaaj i ye'aab' naa ruye'ariik keh ruum i QaJaaw Dios. Eh chi riij i re' naa wo' chik asutiniik taq cho panaye'aab' chuwach chaloq i nim ha' Jordán, panelb'aal reje i q'iij. Eh kora'j taq i naa awehchaam chi korik re' i ye'aab' xuyeew taq kahnoq aweh i Moisés raj kamanoom i Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' keh je' wili inchaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj neen qa a'n chu'nchel i xaq'or qeh, nee wo' hoq ooj xa aha' pa' nee qoh ataq'aaj. <verse number="17" style="v" />Xa naa wo' qa'nam chi juneliik aha' wilik naa aq'orom, je' wo' rukab' noq xqa a'n aha' wilik i xuq'or qeh i Moisés. Xa re' la' wi eliik xwihik awuuk' i QaJaaw Dios, je' rukab' noq wihik ruuk' i Moisés. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh awach i ma' nee ta tirunimaj, eh ma' nee ta rub'an aha' wilik taqe i neenaq'or re' reh inchol chi neenkanteesjik, xa re' inqaq'or aweh i hat chi chakowej awiib', eh cha chop ak'ux, inki taqe.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Josué xutaq'aaj rutahariik nik' wach noq wilik i tinamit Jericó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq wilkeeb' ar Sitim, re' Josué rak'uun i Nun kiib' i winaq xutaq'aaj chutahariik i ye'aab' chi ma' eht'alimaj, je' wili i xuq'or keh: Hiy taq chatah i ye'aab' Canaán je' wo' hoq i Jericó, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' keh xiooj wo' hoq, eh noq xi ponik, ar xkian kipatal jinaj aq'ab' chupaam i rupaat i jinaj i k'oyoom laj ixoq Raab rub'ihnaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Xa re' la' wilik i xponik q'oroq reh i kireey i aj Jericó, je' wili xuq'or reh:</para>
  <para style="p">Chanab'eej noq wilik taqe i winaq re' ruuk' taqe i aj Israel wilkeeb' ayu' xchalik kikoj rehtaal nik' wach noq wilik i qaye'aab', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' reey xutaq'aaj ruq'orariik reh i Raab chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hat chawesaj taqe chaloq i winaq wilkeeb' awuuk' panapaat, ruum, re' taqe re' xakojol taqe rehtaal nik' wach noq wilik i qaye'aab', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' Raab rukeb'aam chik taqe i kiib' chi winaq je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Korik chi wilik taqe i winaq xi k'ulik wuuk' xa re' la' ma' weht'al taj aha' kichalik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Noq xokik aq'ab' xiooj ruum chupaam i ora re' re' intz'ahpik i ru puertahiil i tinamit ma' weht'al taj aha' xiooj. Wila' re' taq i hat xat'ooj chikiij chi jumehq'iil reh i kisik'ariik noq i nuq'or i hin chi konee taqe nareq wach b'eeh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i Raab xujosaj taqe i kiib' chi winaq re' re' chinaah i rupaat, ar xukeb'aa' taqe chupaam i juntuhb' chi ruche'el lino k'ahchi' ruchiqsam ar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i winaq xutaq'aaj reje i reey xkitahqeej reje i kiib' chi winaq aj tahool chupaam i b'eeh inooj chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán xi ponik cho aha' ma' cham ta wii' i ha'. Eh noq xi elik taqe reje i aj sik'ool re' re' manlik tz'ahpik i ru puertahiil i tinamit. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh noq komajaa' inqajik i kiwiriik taqe i kiib' chi winaq kojol rehtaal i tinamit re' i Raab xjohtik johtoq chinaah i rupaat je' wili i xuq'or keh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin weht'al chi re' QaJaaw Dios xuyeew taq chik aweh i ye'aab' wili. Eh xat rutaq'aaj taq chaloq reh chi ma' k'isiin naa qayo'jiik taq awuum, eh chu'nchel taqe i patim ayu' xakimik chik keh ruum kiyo'jiik awuum taq i hat. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruum re' hoj xqib'iraj chi re' Dios xuchiqsaj i kaq palaw noq xat ik'ik taq cho chupaam, noq xat elik taq cho Egipto. Eh xqib'iram wo' rib'iral chi xasach taq kiwach chi jumpech i kiib' chi reey, re' i Sahón, eh re' Og re' i kiib' chi kireey taqe i aj amorreo wilkeeb' naq chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ruum taqe re', re' hoj yohb'aal wach i qayo'jiik xchalik ruum ma' jino'q qeehoj neerukuy i peleto taq awuuk', ruum re' aaWaJaaw aaDios taq i hat, re' wo' Dios wilik rajaawriik pan taxaaj, re' wo' Dios wilik rajaawriik wach ak'al. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' hin i nupahqaaj taq aweh chi cha q'or taq weh i xti korik parub'ihnaal taq i aaWaJaaw aaDios chi naa taq a'nam otob'il keh taqe i awach weh, je' rukab' noq xnub'an taq otob'il aweh i hat. Re' hin inwaaj chi nee taq inaq'or jino'q weh i q'orik rehtaliil chi naa taq a'nam i nuq'or taq aweh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Inwaaj i hin chi ma' nee ta taq inakansaj taqe i nutuut wajaaw, taqe i was, i nuchaaq' winaq, taqe i was nuchaaq' ixoq, taqe i awach keh. Je' re' noq chako'leej taq riij i qak'achariik chi qunchelaal, inki Raab.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiib' chi winaq je' wili i chaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">I ruk'ul chi re' i Dios nee qoh rukansaj wila' ma' xqako'leej riij taq ak'achariik, xa re' la' ma' awach ta aj eh neenaq'or. Eh noq re' i QaJaaw Dios ruye'em chik qeh i ye'aab' wili, eh naa qaketelaam taq awach, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i rupaat i Raab chinaah i tz'aq kotimaj wii' riij i tinamit korjinaq, xa chupaam jinaj i ventana taqe xresaj chaloq, eh ruuk' jinaj i laso xuqasaj taqe qohoq pant'uylik chi juntar i tz'aq'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or reje keh:</para>
  <para style="p">Chupaam i rax chee' taq chak'am reje reh chi ma' nee ta taq ti kireq i k'ahchi' kisik' wiik taq aweh. Chakeb'aa' pee taq awiib' ar ixib'-oq q'iij, korehtaal kisutinik chee keh pan tinamit, chi riij i re' nee taq tiooj chawach i hat ruuk' ab'eeh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiib' chi winaq, je' wili xkiq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj naa qa'nam i xqaq'or xti korik chi riij re' xapahqaaj qeh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Xa re' la' noq naaqokiik chupaam i tinamit wili re' hat naa arapaam cho pan ventana i kaq laso wili re' i xoj aqasaj wii'. Eh neenamol kiwach panapaat atuut awajaaw, taqe aawas achaaq' winaq, aawas achaaq' ixoq, chu'nchel i awach reh aawajaaw. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh wila' awach jino'q keh i re' nee kielik cho chi riij apaat, xa re' reh neerusik' rukimiik chi rib'il riib', ma' re' ta qamahk i hoj. Eh wila' awach kaansanik jino'q reh i naa kiwihiik panapaat wach qanaah i hoj neenkahnik i rukimiik. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh wila' re' hat xak'utjaaj chi xoj wihik awuuk' ma' ruman ta chik chi neenqa'an aha' wilik i xqaq'or i xti korik chi riij chi naa qa'nam, re' i xqaq'or aweh, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ma' xta reet je' re' i naaqa'nam, inki noq chaq'wik i Raab.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh xuch'aq taqe reje i kiib' chi winaq re' re', re' keh xiooj, chi riij i re', re' i Raab xurapaa' wo' hoq i kaq laso chuwach i ventana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kiib' chi tahal ye'aab' xiooj pantaq rax chee', ar xkikeb'aa' kiib' chuwach ixib' q'iij. Eh re' taqe i aj sik'ool xa kitukik chik chi kisik'ariik, xama' xkireq ta wo' hoq xkilow chi je' re' xi sutinik wo' chik reje pan tinamit Jericó. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i xi ponik tahal i ye'aab' xiqajik cho paraxchee', xi q'ahxik wo' chik chaloq chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán xi k'ulik wo' chik iloq aha' wilik wii' i Josué, eh kik'utjaaj reh i Josué chu'nchel i xponik kik'ul. <verse number="24" style="v" />Je' wili i xkiq'or reh i Josué: Re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj chik panqaq'ab' chu'nchel i ye'aab' xponik qilow, ruum chu'nchel i patim ar xchalik kikimiik ruum kiyo'jiik noq xkib'iraj chi wilkooj ar i hoj, inki taqe.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj Israel xkiq'at reje wach i nim ha' Jordán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh kowahq'eq chi junwaar xelik reje chupaam i ye'aab' Sitim i Josué ruch'ihil chu'nchel i aj Israel, xi ponik chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. Ko xi okik chi hi'lik ar ma' xkiqat ta pee reje wach i nim ha'. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh noq xik'ik ixib' q'iij, re' taqe k'amal kib'eeh xponik kib'ehuj paam i wilkeeb' wii' chi hi'lik. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xkiq'or keh i aj Israel: Noq nee taq inawilow chi neenik'ik i loq'laj kaxa molooj wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw chi kik'amam taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' taqe i aj Levíta. Re' taq i hat jumehq'iil taq nee ti elik chaloq panaye'aab' nee taq i nataqeej reje. <verse number="4" style="v" />Chi je' re' nee taq i nanaab'eej aha' taq nee nak'am reje, ruum re' taq i hat ma' jank'al ta taq ti ik'ik chupaam i b'eeh re' re'. Xa re' la' maajil taq i koq awiib' ruuk' i loq'laj kaxa, jinaj miil b'ara chi riij naa taq ab'ehiik reje, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i tinamit cha santoheej taq awiib' ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios i iqal i rub'an chaloq taqe i nimaq kiwach ma' ilooj taj, inki. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or keh i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij: Re' taq i hat chak'am taq reje i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Re' keh xkik'am wo' reje i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i k'uhb'aal, xiooj chi peet b'eeh chikiwach i tinamit. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Chupaam i q'iij wili naa rutohq'iik nuye'em awajaawriik chikiwach taqe i aj Israel. Chi je' re' naa kikojom rehtaal i keh chi re' hin wilkiin awuuk' cha toob'jiik, je' rukab' noq xinwihik ruuk' i Moisés. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' hat cha q'or keh i k'amal kib'eeh i aj tiij chi neenkik'am reje i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i k'uhb'aal. Eh noq nee kiponik chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán neekiokik i koq k'isinoq panha', ar neekipahik, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i aj Israel: Kim taq ayu' chab'iraj taq i ruq'or aaWaJaaw aaDios. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' i wili naa taq akojom wii' rehtaal chi re' k'achlik Dios wilik taq panaxilak, re' i naa rutehem taq ab'eeh, eh naa resam taq panab'eeh taqe i aj cananeo, i aj heteo, i aj heveo, i aj ferezeo, i aj gergeseo, i aj amorreo, i aj jebuseo. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios ehchan reh chu'nchel i wach ak'al naa rojiik chi peet b'eeh taq chawach noq naa taq aq'atam wach i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruum aj re' yu'naak cha sik' taq kiwach kab'laj-oq chi winaq ju'jun taq i naa asik'im kiwach chupaam i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios, eh cha a'n reh chu'nchel i wach ak'al neentohq'ik kikojom i koq i kooq chupaam i nim ha' Jordán, re' i ha' kiib' nee nelik re' inchalik taxaaj naa rumolom riib' pantaq rucheel ma' naa ta chik rub'eeh rooq'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i aj Israel xi elik chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat wilkeeb' wii' xkiq'at reje wach i nim ha' Jordán. Eh re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij xik'am wik reh i loq'laj kaxa xk'amwik reje kib'eeh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i nim ha' Jordán kow i b'ehik i rub'an i rooq' ruum paruq'ijil i rumolariik i wach taqe tik mu'uun i nelik taqe chi chii'. Ruum aj re' noq xi okik i koq chi chii' i nim ha' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa xponik nah kich'ehk i xtz'aqik. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' rooq ha' inchalik taxaaj xpa'lojik xumol riib' xponik ma' najt ta ruuk' i tinamit Adam wilik chu'nchel i ye'aab' Saretán. Eh ma' xooj ta chik qohoq i rooq' i ha' re' re' chupaam i kamnaq palaw, je' re' noq xuch'aq riib' i ha' noq xpa'lojik. Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xi q'ahxik reje chi juntar i nim ha' chi korkiil i tinamit Jericó. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit Israel panchiqiij ki-ik'ik noq xkiq'at wach i nim ha' Jordán. Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xi k'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa wilik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios panchiqiij pa'alkeeb' panyejaal i nim ha Jordán.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' q'orik chi riij i kab'laj chi ab'aj xsik'arik wach chupaam i nim ha' Jordán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh noq ik'inaq chik taqe reje i aj Israel chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán, re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat cha sik' kiwach kab'laj-oq i winaq ju'jun i naa asik'im wach chi kixilak i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh chi kesaj ju'jun kab'aaj panyejaal i nim ha' Jordán, re' pa'alkeeb' wii' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij reh chi neenkik'am reje neen kiyeew chupaam i ye'aab' naa taq akahniik wii' chupaam aq'ab' yu'naak, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' i Josué xuyuq'eej ruuk' taqe i kab'laj chi winaq xusik' kiwach chi kixilak i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh je' wili xuq'or keh: Okeen taq i koq panyejaal i nim ha' Jordán chuwach i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal taq aaWaJaaw aaDios cha ju'junaal taq chawesaj cho ju'jun-oq ab'aj nee taq i nayeew cho nah atileb'. Eh kab'laj chi ab'aj taq i neenawesaj chaloq ju'jun keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taqe ab'aj re' re' naa rukahniik chi rehtalil chib'ih i xub'an i QaJaaw Dios. Eh noq naa taq kipahqaam aweh awak'uun awixq'uun chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih reet noq wilkeeb' ayu' ab'aj wili? inko'q taqe. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taq i hat je' wili kichaq'weesjiik taq naa a'nam: Re' taqe ab'aj wili rehtaliil chi xchiqik i nim ha' Jordán xuch'aq riib' noq xk'ik'saj juntar ha' i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios. Re' wo' taqe ab'aj wili naa rukamaniik chi rehtalil reh chi naa ruk'uliik pankik'ux chi juneliik i aj Israel chib'ih i xub'an i Dios ayu', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kab'laj chi winaq xkian wo' hoq i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué, xkesaj wo' chaloq ju'jun kab'aaj panyejaal i nim ha' Jordán kab'laj chi ab'aj i xkesaj ju'jun keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. Eh xkik'am reje ko aha' xkiyejaa' wii' ki-itz'ihy naah paat, ar xkimol wach je' wo' rukab' i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Josué. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué reh xumol wo' wach i kab'laj chi ab'aj panyejaal i nim ha' Jordán re' i xipahik wii' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios. Eh re' taqe i kab'laj chi ab'aj re' re' ar xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa xi kahnik paa' panyejaal i nim ha' Jordán, noq re' taqe i aj Israel xkian chu'nchel i xuq'or i Dios re' i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué. Eh nik' wach i ruq'orom chee i Moisés reh i Josué, je' wo' re' rub'aan xkian chu'nchel. Eh re' taqe i aj Israel ki-ik'ik chi jumehq'iil chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh noq ki-ik'ik chi juntar i nim ha' chu'nchel i tinamit ki-ik'ik wo' reje chi juntar i nim ha', chi peet b'eeh taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij i kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén, re' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, re' i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam Manasés kichopom kitz'a'amb'aal noq xik'ik chi peet b'eeh chikiwach i aj Israel, je' rukab' i q'orooj cho keh ruum i Moisés. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh je' naak'isiin ma' ka'winaq miil i kichopom kitz'a'amb'aal i kiyejaam kiib' chi q'aq'inik xiooj wach k'ixkaab' Jericó chuwach i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="14" style="v" />Chupaam i q'iij re' re' xye'arik runimaal wach i Josué ruum i QaJaaw Dios, reh chi re' taqe i aj Israel kiyohleej wach i Josué chupaam chu'nchel i ruk'achariik, je' wo' rukab' noq xkiyohleej wach i Moisés noq xub'an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hat cha q'or keh i k'amal kib'eeh i aj tiij kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios chi kieloq cho chupaam i nim ha' Jordán, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué xuq'or wo' keh chi xi elik cho ar. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq xi elik cho chupaam i nim ha' Jordán, taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' noq xi elik cho chi chiq yuuq xuk'ul wo' chik lom riib' i nim ha' xutoq'aa' wo' chik elik chi taq chii' je' rukab' i pampeet.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xi elik reje chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán chupaam i lajeeb' rub'eeh i peet poh reh i haab'. Eh ar xooj kiyejaa' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat Gilgal wilik reje chi korkiil i reelb'aal q'iij reh i Jericó. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué ar xumol kiwach taqe i kab'laj chi ab'aj xkesaj chaloq chupaam i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or keh i aj Israel noq naa kipahqaam taq aweh awak'uun awixq'uun na' chub'an chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih reet noq wilkeeb' taqe ayu' ab'aj wili? inko'q taqe. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat je' wili kichaq'weesjiik taq naa a'nam: Re' taqe ab'aj wili rehtalil chi panchiqiij xoj ik'ik noq xqaq'at wach i nim ha' Jordán, tiko'q taq. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios korik wo' hoq chi xuchiqsaj i nim ha' Jordán noq xoj ik'ik ar je' rukab' noq xuchiqsaj i kaq palaw noq xoj ik'ik cho chupaam i hoj najtir. <verse number="24" style="v" />Chi je' re' chu'nchel i tinamit wach ak'al naakinab'iniik reh chi re' QaJaaw qaDios i hoj xiik' nah i runimaal i rajaawriik. Eh reh wo' hoq chi nee taq inayohleej wach i hat chi juneliik, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat xkiyejaa' ar Gilgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chu'nchel i kireey i aj amorreo wilkeeb' parookb'aal q'iij reh i nim ha' Jordán, je' wo' chu'nchel i reey wilkeeb' ma' naj ta chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, noq xkib'iraj chi re' i QaJaaw Dios xuchiqsaj i nim ha' Jordán noq ki-ik'ik chupaam i aj Israel, ma' k'isiin ta xchalik kiyo'jiik, eh ma' xkichop ta kik'ux chi kik'ulb'ejiik i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re', re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Re' hat cha yejaa' taqe i kuchilo ab'aj neenaq'asb'isaj, ruuk' i re' nee wo' chik inayok' i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab' awuch aj Israel, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué xuyejaa' wo' taqe i kuchilo ab'aj ruuk' i re' xuyok' i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab' chu'nchel i winaq aj Israel chinaah i yuuq' Aralot. <verse number="4" style="v" />Xiyok' i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab' ruum re' taqe i winaq b'anooj keh i re' manlik i kihab'ul reh ojik pankuartel noq xi elik cho Egipto kamnaq chik taqe cho wach b'eeh chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i winaq aj Israel xi elik cho Egipto yok'ooj chaloq i rutz'uhmal i naah i kik'achab', eh re' taqe i winaq xi-aasjik cho wach b'eeh noq xib'ehik cho chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' ma' yok'ooj ta naq i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel ka'winaq haab' xib'ehik chaloq chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq', kamnaq chik taqe chu'nchel i winaq manlik i kihab'ul reh ojik pankuartel noq xi elik cho Egipto. Re' keh ma' xkinimaj taj i QaJaaw Dios, ruum aj re' xq'orarik keh i xti korik ruum i QaJaaw chi ma' naa ta kiponiik chupaam i ye'aab' xq'orarik cho keh i kimaam kati't chi naa ruye'ariik keh. Re' i ye'aab' i nelik wii' chu'nchel i suq atoob'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' Josué xuyok' i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab' i kak'uun taqe i winaq re' re', re' taqe i xikanab'jik ruum i QaJaaw Dios chi kijilow i keh. Re' taqe i re' ma' yok'ooj ta naq i rutz'uhmal i naah i kik'achab', ruum b'ehik naq inki a'n chaloq'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh noq yok'ooj chik i rutz'uhmal naah i kik'achab' chi kunchelaal xi kahnik chi hi'lik chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat korehtaal chik xik'achjik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Yu'naak ruum chi xb'aan keh i re' chu'nchel i winaq xwesaj taq ak'ixb'ilaal xkiyeew taq cha naah i aj Egipto, inki. Ruum aj re', re' i ye'aab' re' re' Gilgal i b'ih xokik, je' re' i rub'ihnaal xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkiyejaa' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat ar Gilgal wahq'eq xi okik ar chupaam i kajlaj rub'eeh i poh, eh xkininq'ijeej i elik chaloq Egipto ar wach k'ixkaab' Jericó. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re' xkik'ux i kaxlanwi'k ma' kojooj ta ch'amb'esb'al reh, je' wo' hoq i k'ilimaj wach trigo. Eh chi junwaar chik re' chik xkik'ux i wach i tik i nelik ar Canaán. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re' xkikanaa' ruk'uxariik chi jumpech i maná taqe i aj Israel re' chik i tik i nelik ar Canaán i kik'uxlaaj wii' kiib' chuwach i haab' re' re'.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Josué, eh re' k'amal b'eeh ru soldado i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh noq re' Josué ma' najt ta wilik ruuk' i Jericó xrilow chi jinaj i winaq pa'lik ar ruchopom ruq'aslaj ch'ihch'. Eh re' Josué xujil i koq riib' ruuk' xupahqaaj reh chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">¿Mi chi xilak i qa soldado i hoj wilkaat i hat, oon chi kixilak i ki soldado i ki-ixowanik qawach? inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' winaq je' wili i chaq'wik xub'an: Ni xata hin taq aweh i hat, ni xata hin keh i ki-ixowanik taq awach, re' hin, hin k'amal kib'eeh i ru soldado i QaJaaw Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' i Josué xupach'aa' qohoq riib' korehtaal xureq wach ak'al ruuk' i yejal wach, xupahqaaj reh chi je' wili.</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hin, hin awaj kamanoom. ¿Chib'ih nawaaj chi nee nub'an? inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i k'amal kib'eeh i ru soldado i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or reh Josué:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hat chawesaj axijab' cha wooq ruum re' i ye'aab' pa'alkaat wii' santo laj ye'aab', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' Josué xub'an wo' hoq i xq'orarik reh.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruyejeb'jiik wach i ruchopariik naah i tinamit Jericó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh xkitz'ap chi korik taqe i ookb'al reh i tinamiit Jericó, ruum i kiyo'jiik chikiwach i aj Israel, xama' awach ta naq chik i nelik inokik i koq ar. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Re' hin xnuq'asaj chik panaq'ab' i tinamit Jericó ruch'ihil i kireey je' wo' taqe i ki soldado. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taq i hat ki soldado i aj Israel naa taq akotem riij i tinamit, ju'jun riim chuwach i q'iij, eh je' re' taq naa a'nam chuwach i waqiib' q'iij. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh wuquub' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naa kik'amam ju'jun chi ruk'aa' imas tentzun, naa kojiik chi peet b'eeh chuwach i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i k'uhb'aal. Eh paru wuuq' q'iij wuquub' pech taq naa akotem riij i Jericó, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naakixulem paam taqe i uk'aa' re' re'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh noq naa taq ab'iram i hat chi kow naakixulem paam i ruk'aa' imas tentzun naa taq ak'erem aachii' chi q'orariik chi je' wili: Re' koraal tz'aq kotimaj wii' riij i tinamit naa ruch'a'lojiik wach ak'al, tiko'q taq. Eh re' taq i hat jumehq'iil taq nee ti okik i koq chi peleto kuuk' i tinamit re' re', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué xuyuq'eej taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, je' wili i xuq'or keh: Chak'am taq reje i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw. Eh wuquub' taq aweh i nee kiooj chi peet chuwach i loq'laj kaxa, eh neenkik'am ju'jun kuiruk'aa' imas tentzun. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh je' wilik i xuq'or keh i tinamit: Hiy taq chakotej riij i tinamit Jericó. Eh re' taqe i soldado wilik kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' naa kojiik chi peet b'eeh chuwach i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu'nchel i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué xkian wo' hoq. Re' taqe i wuquub' chi k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xiooj wo' chi peet b'eeh chuwach i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw, eh chi kiju'junaal k'ahchi' reje kixulem paam i ruk'aa' imas tentzun. Eh re' i loq'laj kaxa xam reje chikiij. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i soldado peet b'eeh taqe reje chikiwach i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. Eh wilik wo' taqe i soldado xam taqe reje chi riij i loq'laj kaxa. Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xama' inkikanaa' ta chik ruxuljiik i ruk'aa' imas tentzun. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i soldado: Re' taq i hat naa taq ab'eeh reje chi ma' xta taq choqik naa a'nam, konaa taq nuq'orom aweh kora'j taq neenak'er aachii' chi kow re', inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' noq xchoparik naah i tinamit Jericó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Josué xuq'or keh chi re' loq'laj kaxa naa rojiik rukotem riij i tinamit Jericó, chi riij i re' xi sutinik wo' chik cho chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat, eh ar xkik'saj aq'ab'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chi junwaar chik kowahq'eq xwuktik i Josué, eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xkik'am wo' chik reje i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i wuquub' chi k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xiooj chi peet b'eeh chuwach i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw, b'ehik, inki a'n reje eh xama' inkikanaa' ta chik i ruxuljiik i ruk'aa' imas tentzun. Re' taqe i soldado peet b'eeh reje chikiwach, eh wilik wo' taqe i xam reje chi riij i loq'laj kaxa. Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xama' inkimay ta chik ruxuljiik paam i ruk'aa' tentzun. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh panrukab' q'iij xooj wo' chik kikotej riij i tinamit Jericó, chi riij i re' xi sutinik wo' chik chaloq chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat. Eh waqiib' q'iij xkian chi ju'junriim xkikotej riij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ruwuuq q'iij kowahq'eq xi wuktik xooj wo' chik kikotej riij i tinamit Jericó, je' wo' rukab' i kian pampeet, xa re' la' wuqpech chik xkikotej riij chupaam i q'iij re' re'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xkixulej i paruwuuq pech i ruk'aa' imas tentzun, re' Josué, je' wili xuq'or keh i soldado: Chak'er taq aachii' chi kow, ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios xuqasaj taq chik panaq'ab' i tinamit Jericó. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' tinamit re' re' naa rusahchiik wach, je' wo' chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam, je' rukab' i ruq'orom i QaJaaw Dios. Xa re' wo' hoq Raab i k'oyoom laj ixoq naa rukohliik riij i ruk'achariik ruch'ihil taqe i kikeb'aam kiib' parupaat, ruum xukeb'aa' taqe i kiib' chi winaq xqataq'aaj taqe reje chi tahool. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taq i hat chawik'raaj taq awiib' ma' jino'q i chib'ih jariik wilik chupaam i tinamit re' re' naa taq achopom. Ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios ruq'orom chik chi naa rusacham wach, je' wo' chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam, ruum wila' chih taq i xachop neenchalik i ti' k'axik taq cha naah chupaam taq aapaat itz'ihy naah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i xa chib'ih jariik korjinaq ruuk' oro, ruuk' plata, ch'ihch' neerub'an chi nee taq inamol, ruum re' re' naa ruq'ahxiik reh i QaJaaw naa rumolariik chupaam i molarik wii' i chib'ih inkamanik reh i QaJaaw, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kow xkixulej taqe i ruk'aa' imas tentzun, chu'nchel i aj Israel xkik'er kichii' chi kow. Eh re' tz'aq kotimaj wii' riij i tinamit Jericó xanoq wo' ch'alojik wach ak'al, eh re' taqe i aj Israel jumehq'iil xi okik i koq chupaam i tinamit re' re', eh xkichop naah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh xkikansaj ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i tinamit chi winaq chi ixoq chi nimaq chi kok' taq. Eh re' taqe i b'ooyax, taqe i tentzuun, taqe i b'uurux, xkuxik kisacham wach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i kiib' chi winaq i xi ponik tah woq reh i ye'aab': Re' taq i hat hiy taq parupaat i Raab i k'oyoom laj ixoq chawesaj taq cho ar i reh, je' wo' chu'nchel i awach reh wilkeeb' ruuk', je' rukab' aq'orom taq reh, inki. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kiib' chi winaq xiooj wo' parupaat i Raab xkesaj chee reh ruch'ihil irutuuti rajaaw, ruch'ihil taqe i ras ruchaaq', taqe chu'nchel i awach reh. Eh ar xkik'am reje kochiriij i wilik wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat i aj Israel. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xkikoj ruq'aq'al i tinamit Jericó xk'ahtik, eh xkuxik ruk'ahtiik chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam. Eh xa re' wo' xkesaj i xa chib'ih jariik korjinaq ruuk' oro, ruuk' plata, ruuk' q'an ch'ihch', ruuk' rax ch'ihch', ar xkimol chupaam i ye'aab' reh i chib'ih inkamanik reh i QaJaaw. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xuko'leej riij i ruk'achariik i Raab, ruch'ihil awach reh parupaat, ruum re' reh xukeb'aa' i kiib' chi winaq xutaq'aaj reje chutahariik i tinamit Jericó, eh chupaam taqe q'iij re' re', re' taqe i riih rumaam Raab xi okik cho chi k'achariik chi kixilak i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re', re' Josué xuq'or i xti korik je' wili i xuq'or: Neeta naq inye'arik panti' k'axik ruum i QaJaaw Dios i awach i neraaj ruyejaam ruka'peech i tinamit wili. Eh nee ta naq inkimik i peet rak'uun awach i nee raaj rukojom i tz'aq reh i riij i tinamit wili. Eh nee ta naq inkimik i chaaq'b'ees neraaj ruyejaam taqe i ookb'al, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué xtoob'jik ruum i QaJaaw Dios, eh re' taqe i xuq'or i Josué xelik rib'iral chupaam chu'nchel i ye'aab' re' re'.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' mahk xub'an i Acán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jinaj i winaq aj Judío Acán rub'ihnaal rak'uun i Carmi riih i Zabdi, xikin riih Zera, wili taqe i xa chib'ih jariik xuchop, re' ruuk' i ruq'orom i Dios chi naa rusahchiik kiwach. Ruum chi xuchop taqe re' chi kunchelaal i aj Israel xkahnik wach kinaah i mahk re' re' ruum i QaJaaw Dios, eh ma' k'isiin ta xchalik i rujosq'iil chikinaah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh koq'uun chik re' Josué noq wilkeeb' ar Jericó wilik taqe i winaq xutaq'aaj reje pan tinamit Hai, re' wilik parelb'aal q'iij reh i Bet-el, ma' najt ta ruuk' i Bet-avén, je' wili i xuq'or reje keh: Hiy taq chatah i tinamit Hai, inki, re' taqe i winaq re' re' xooj wo' kitaah i tinamit. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh noq xi sutinik chaloq je' wili i xkiq'or reh i Josué: Ma' koruman taj chi chu'nchel i qatinamiit Israel nee kiooj Hai kiib' oon ixib' miil chi winaq manlik nee kiooj chi peleto ar, eh neen kichop naah i tinamit re' re'. Ruum re' kicha'jinik reh i tinamit re' re' xa, ma' k'ih ta taqe, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xa ixib' miil chi winaq i xijohtik chub'anariik reh i tinamit Hai. Xa re' la' re' taqe i aj Hai wilik i aj Israel xkian reh, eh wilik i xkajimaj chaloq. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Hai waqlaj ru ka'winaq i xkikansaj chi kixilak i aj Israel. Eh re' taqe i ruk'ihaal xkajimaj chaloq pan tinamit, xi k'ulik kanab'joq panqajik inehteesjik wii' ab'aj. Eh ruum i xb'aan keh re' re' chu'nchel i aj Israel xub'an kiib' kik'ux, xchalik kiyo'jiik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' Josué, ruch'ihil taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel xkiweq i kiso' xkipukej i pooq wach kinaah ruum ruti'kiil kik'ux. Eh kipach'aa' qohoq kiib' korehtaal xkireq wach ak'al ruuk' i yejal kiwach chuwach i koq i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios, korehtaal chik xokik i q'iij. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">QaJaaw Dios xti ti' wo' chik ¿Chib'ih reet noq xawik'saj taqe chaloq juntar i nim ha' Jordán taqe i aj Israel? ¿Mi xa re' nawaaj re' chi naakooj aq'asam pan kiq'ab' taqe i aj amorreo reh chi naa kisacham qawach? Ma' xta naq reet chi xoj kahnik ta cho chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="8" style="v" />QaJaaw Dios ¿Chib'ih i ruk'ul chi nee nuq'or yu'naak? ruum re' taqe i aj Israel xkimol cho chi elik chikiwach i aj ixowaal. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj cananeo, je' wo' taqe i patim chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' noq neenkib'iraj chib'ih i xk'ularik neenchalik kisach qawach pankomonil. Eh ¿Chib'ih i neen q'orarik chi riij i runimaal wach ab'ihnaal? inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruchaq'weesjiik xub'an:</para>
  <para style="p">Josué wukteen johtoq, Chib'ih jariik i napachib'ej ar wach ak'al. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe i awuch aj Israel ximahkunik chi nuwach ma' xkinimaj taj i k'uhb'aal xnuyejaa' wach kuuk', wilik i chib'ih jariik xkik'am chaloq re' naq ruuk' i naa rusachariik kiwach. Eh xkelq'aaj, xanaah re' keht'al wo' naq chi ma' toob' ta xkikeb'aa' chi xilak i chib'ih keh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' taqe i aj Israel re' re' ma' nee ta inkikuy ruk'ulb'eejiik taqe i aj ixowaal. Naa la' kimolom chi elik chikiwach, ruum aj re', re' taqe i aj Israel i ruk'ul chi naa rusachariik kiwach yu'naak. Eh wila' ma' xasach taq wach i hat i nuq'orom i hin chi naa rusahchiik kiwach, re' hin ma' naa ta chik nuwihiik taq awuuk'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hat Josué cha q'or keh i tinamit chi kisaqb'isaj kiib' reh chi nee kichalik chi nuwach iqal. Re' hin i hin taq aaWaJaaw aaDios je' wili nuq'or: Re' taq i hat aj Israel xawelq'aaj taq chaloq i naa naq rusachariik kiwach. Wila' ma' xasach taq wach, wila' ma' xawesaj taq reje chaxilak ma' jaruuj taq chik naa akuyum i peleto kuuk' i ki-ixowanik taq awach, kinki. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat wahq'eq i iqal ti chaloq taq chi nuwach chi ch'uhqaal taq aatinamiit, aha' wilik ch'uq i naa nuq'orom i hin chi naa ruchaliik chi nuwach naa wo' ruchaliik, ruch'ihil taqe awach reh parupaat. Eh aha' wilik junch'uq chi patineel naa nuq'orom i hin chi naakichaliik, naa wo' kichaliik chi nuwach jarub' chi winaq wilkeeb' panupaat. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh awach aj uuk' neenkan i naa naq rusahchiik kiwach inchol chi naa ruk'ahtiik i reh, je' wo' chu'nchel i awach reh, chu'nchel i chib'ih reh. Ruum xub'an i yiib' wach na'ojb'al ma' ruk'ul ta chi b'anarik chi kixilak i aj Israel ma' xunimaj taj i nuyejaam wach i hin, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' Josué kowahq'eq xwuktik chi junwaar, eh xuq'or keh i aj Israel chi naa kichaliik chi kich'uhqaal, xumol kiwach i aj Israel. Eh re' i ruch'uhqaal i riih rumaam Judá xk'uhtjik reh i Josué, ruum i Dios. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' Josué xuq'or chi naakichaliik i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Judá, eh chi kixilak i re' xk'uhtjik taqe riih rumaam i Zera, eh chi riij i re' xik'ik taqe awach reh parupaat i Zera. Eh chi kixilak taqe i xk'uhtjik i riih rumaam Zabdi. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq xiooj k'oloq chi kiju'junaal taqe i winaq i riih rumaam i Zabdi. Eh chi kixilak taqe re' xureq i QaJaaw Dios chi re' Acán wilik ru mahk. Re' Acán re' re' rak'uun i Carmi, riih i Zabdi, xikin riih rumaam Zera. Re' taqe re', re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam Judá.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' i Josué je' wili i xuq'or reh i Acán:</para>
  <para style="p">Wila' re' hat inawaaj aye'em runimaal wach, inawaaj aye'em ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios cha q'or weh chib'ih jariik i xa a'n ma' keb'aa' chi nuwach, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' Acán je' wili i chaq'wik xub'an:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hin i nuq'or i korik chi ximahkunik chuwach i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel, re' taqe i wili i xnub'an: <verse number="21" style="v" />Noq xoj okik Jericó chi kixilak taqe i chib'ih jariik xwilow wach jinaj i holohik itz'ihy inchalik Babilonia, xwilow wach i kiib' siento chi tumiin plata, xwilow wach i junrahp chi oro ik'inaq naa jinaj libra rahliil, eh xnuk'am taqe chi weh. Eh xnuk'ot jinaj i jul panyejaal i nu itz'ihy naah paat, ar taqe xnumuq'aa', eh chi ri'sil taqe re' xnuyeew i tumiin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' i Josué wilik taqe i winaq xutaq'aaj chupaam i ru-itz'ihy naah paat i Acán. Eh ar wo' xponik kireq chu'nchel i rukeb'aam i Acán, chi ri'sil wo' xkireq i tumiin. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh xkik'am reje chuwach i Josué, eh chikiwach chu'nchel i aj Israel. Eh kiq'asaj chuwach i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' Josué, eh chu'nchel i aj Israel xkichop i Acán xkik'am reje chuwach k'ixkaab' Acor, ruch'ihil itz'ihy ruch'ihil i tumiin, ruch'ihil i junrahp chi oro, ruch'ihil wo' taqe i rak'uun rixq'uun. Eh xkik'am wo' taqe i rub'oyaax i rutentzuun, ruch'ihil i ru-itz'ihy naah paat, je' wo' chu'nchel i chib'ih reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or reh i Acán:</para>
  <para style="p">¿Chib'ih reet noq xak'am chee ti' k'axik wili chi qanaah? Yu'naak re' QaJaaw Dios ye'woq jilow aweh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Noq xukohlaaj ruq'orariik i re' i Josué chu'nchel i aj Israel xkikutib'eej chi ab'aj i Acán, eh xkik'at, je' wo' chu'nchel i rak'uun rixq'uun. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh xkiyeew i juntuhb' chi ab'aj chinaah, eh ar xkahnik chi jumpech. Ruuk' i re' xik'saj i rujosq'iil i QaJaaw Dios. Ruum aj re', re' i ye'aab' re' re' Acor i rub'ihnaal xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj Israel xkichop naah i tinamit Hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Mat yo'jik, maa rub'an kiib' ak'ux. Chak'am taqe reje chu'nchel i soldado hiy chak'ulb'ilej taqe i tinamit Hai. Re' hin nuq'asam chik panaq'ab' i kireey, kitinamiit, i kiye'aab' eh chu'nchel i chib'ih keh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taq i hat naa taq a'nam kuuk' i tinamit Hai je' wo' ruuk' i kireey nik' wach taq i xa a'n ruuk' i tinamit Jericó ruuk' i kireey. Xa re' la' yu'naak neerub'an chi nee taq inkahnik cha weh i xa chib'ih jariik wilik ar, je' wo' taqe i kichikoop, eh chi riij i tinamit nee taq ti okik chaloq chi peleto, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' Josué i xumol kiwach i ru soldado reh chi xutaq'aaj taqe reje chi q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit Hai, xusik' kiwach i lajeeb' ru ka'winaq miil chi q'aq'ineel. Eh chaq'ab' xutaq'aaj taqe reje. <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or reje keh: Chab'iraj taq chi korik ar taq netiokik cho chi riij i tinamit nee taq i naakeb'aa' awiib' ma' najt ta ruuk', eh ayejaam-oq taq awiib' reh i rub'anariik reh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' ruqox i tinamit wuch'ihil taqe i hin noq neekinokik i koq chuwach i tinamit. Eh noq nee kielik chaloq i aj Hai chub'anariik qeh i hoj, neenqamol chi elik i hoj, je' rukab' xa a'n taq i hat junriim. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq neenqamol cho chi elik i hoj chupaam i kitinamiit nee qoh kajimaj chaloq neenkikapaaj chi xoj kesaj wo' chik cho ar. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jumehq'iil taq neti elik chaloq aha' akeb'aam taq awiib', eh nee taq i naachop naah i kitinamiit. Ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios naa ruq'asaniik taq panaq'ab'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh xa re' wach noq nee taq inachop naah chak'at taq, je' rukab' i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios, re' reh xq'orik inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' Josué xuq'or keh chi xi elik reje i soldado. Eh re' keh xiooj wo' hoq ar xooj kikeb'aa' kiib' panyejaal i ye'aab' Bet-el ruuk' i tinamit Hai pareelb'aal q'iij reje reh i Hai. Eh re' Josué reh ko ar xik'saj i jinaj aq'ab' wilkeeb' wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chi junwaar chik kowahq'eq xwuktik i Josué xupech' taqe i ru soldado mi kiyejaam kiib' chi korik. Re' taqe i winaq k'amal b'eeh taqe chi kixilak i aj Israel xiooj chi peet b'eeh chikiwach noq xiooj chi peleto chinaah i tinamit Hai. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i ru soldado xkijil i koq kiib' ruuk' i tinamit Hai chuwach i koq i tinamit xi okik, ar xkiyejaa' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh jinaj i k'ixkaab' xkahnik pankiyejaal ruuk' i tinamit. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' Josué hoob' miil chi soldado i xukeb'aa' panyejaal i ye'aab' Bet-el ruuk' i tinamit Hai ar reje chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij, reh i tinamit. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' taqe i soldado jun ch'uq i xkikeb'aa' kiib' pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eh junch'uq i xkahnik chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat panrookb'aal q'iij. Eh re' Josué xujil i koq riib' ruuk' i tinamit re' re' xponik kopanyejaal i k'ixkaab'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh noq xrilow i kireey i aj Hai chi xiooj chik k'oloq i Josué panyejaal k'ixkaab', jumehq'iil xelik chaloq ruch'ihil chu'nchel i ru soldado chi kik'uhlb'ejiik taqe i ki soldado i aj Israel wach k'ixkaab' Jordán. Xa re' la' ma' reht'al taj chi wilik i ki soldado i aj Israel kikeb'aam kiib' chi riij i rutinamiit. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado xkimol ti chik chi elik chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xkian kiib' chuwach i ki soldado i aj Hai. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i ki soldado i aj Hai xq'orarik keh chi naa ruchaliik kajimam taqe i ki soldado i aj Israel, ruch'ihil i Josué najt kikanaa' chaloq i kitinamiit. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh ma' jino'q chik i soldado xkahnik cho Hai, ma' jino'q wo' chik i xkahnik cho Bet-el, chi kunchelaal xchalik chi kajimjiik i ki soldado i aj Israel, ruum i re' xkikanaa' chaloq i kitinamiit chi ma' xta cha'jen reh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Re' hat chajosaj reje aq'as laj ch'ihch' wilik pan anq'ab' chinaah i tinamit Hai ruum re' hin naa nuq'asam panaq'ab', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' Josué xujosaj wo' reje chinaah i tinamit i ruq'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i ki soldado i aj Israel kikeb'aam kiib' xi elik cho chi jumehq'iil aha' naq kikeb'aam kiib' xkikutkiib' chinaah i tinamit Hai. Eh xkichop naah i xkikoj ruq'aq'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i ki soldado i aj Hai xitz'ehtanik reje chikiij xkilow chi xamponik chik pan taxaaj i rusib'eel i kitinamiit, xama' aha' ta chik kielik kuum taqe i aj Israel, i xkimol naq chik chi elik chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq', chupaam i q'iij re' re' xkikut kiib' chinaah i tinamit re' re'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh noq rilow i Josué, ruch'ihil chu'nchel i aj Israel chi re' taqe i ki soldado kikeb'aam naq kiib' xkichop naah i tinamit Hai, eh chi xkikoj ruq'aq'al, xi sutinik chikiij eh xoj kik'ulb'ilej taqe i aj Hai. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i xichopwik naah i tinamit xi elik cho ar xchalik kik'ulb'ilej i ki soldado i aj Hai panyejaal i ka'ch'uq chi ki soldado i aj Israel xi kahnik. Re' keh kian reh i ki soldado i aj Hai korehtaal xkuxik kikansam. <verse number="23" style="v" />Xa re' wo' chik i kireey i aj Hai xkikanaa' chi k'achlik, xkichop, eh xkik'am reje chuwach i Josué.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i aj Israel xkuxik kikansam chu'nchel i ki soldado i aj Hai re' taqe i ajiminik cho keh chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xi sutinik wo' chik reje chupaam i tinamit Hai. Eh xkikansaj i xi kahnik naq chi k'achalkeeb'. <verse number="25" style="v" />Chupaam i q'iij re' re' xkikansaj i kab'laj miil chi tinamit patim taqe chupaam i tinamit re' re' chi winaq chi ixoq. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' Josué kore' chik xuq'asaj i ruch'ihch' k'ulq'as rehtalil i taaq'anik reh i q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit noq xkuxik chik kikantesjiik chi jumpech i aj Hai. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkahnik chi keh taqe i chikop, chu'nchel i chib'ih jariik i wilkeeb' chupaam i tinamit Hai, je' wo' rukab' i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Josué. <verse number="28" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' Josué kuxik ruk'atam i tinamit Hai, xusach wach chi jumpech, eh je' xkahnik chi jumpech. <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xut'uyaa' nah q'ab' chee' i kireey i aj Hai korehtaal xokik i q'iij ar xkimik. Eh noq xokik i q'iij xutaq'aaj ruqahteesjiik i ruti'jolal, ar xkikut panookb'al reh i tinamit, eh xkitub'aa' ab'aj chinaah. Eh re' ab'aj re' re' ar xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xrilow wach i k'uhb'aal chinaah i yuuq' Ebal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xuyejaa' jinaj i artaal chinaah i yuuq' Ebal, re' ye'b'al ruloq'il i kaJaaw i ki Dios i aj Israel. <verse number="31" style="v" />Je' rukab' i xuq'or i Moisés raj kamanoom i Dios keh i aj Israel, je' rukab' i tz'ihb'amaj pan santo laj huuj, re' k'uhb'aal xye'arik reh i Moisés. Eh re' artaal re' re' xkiyejaa' ruuk' taqe i ab'aj ma' sehkamaj ta wach. Re' taqe i aj Israel xkik'at i mayiij chinaah i artaal chuwach i QaJaaw Dios, eh xkiyeew wo' chinaah i mayiij k'amb'al iib' panotob'il ruuk' i Dios. <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh re' Josué chikiwach chu'nchel i aj Israel xutz'ihb'aaj chuwach taqe ab'aj i k'uhb'aal ye'ooj reh i Moisés. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i aj Israel, taqe i tokoom tinamit, taqe k'amal b'eeh, taqe i nimaq kiwach, taqe i q'atal q'orik, xkiyeew i koq kiib' pantaq rucheel i loq'laj kaxa molik wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw chikiwach taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij taqe i aj Levíta re' kik'amwik reh i loq'laj kaxa. Re' taqe i tinamit re' re' yejaal i xkiyeew reje kiib' parucheel i yuuq' Gerizim, eh yejaal i xkiyeew reje kiib' parucheel i yuuq' Ebal. Eh xkian wo' hoq ixq'orarik keh pampeet ruum i Moisés raj kamanoom i QaJaaw Dios, reh chi xkik'ul i rotob'il i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh chi riij i re', re' Josué xrilow wach chi ju'junaal chib'ih i ruq'or taqe i k'uhb'aal tz'ihb'amaj, chihreet noq ink'ularik i rotob'il i Dios, eh chihreet noq ink'ularik i ti' k'axik. <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' Josué xrilow wach taqe i k'uhb'aal xye'arik ree Moisés ma' xtaj i xukanaa' chi ma' ta xrilow wach chikiwach i aj Israel, chi winaq, chi ixoq, chi kok' ha'lak'uun, eh chi tokoom tinamit wilkeeb' ar.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i tinamit Gabaón xkichuk i q'orik reh i Josué</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' taqe i kireey i aj heteo, i aj amorreo, i aj cananeo, i aj ferezeo, i aj heveo, i aj jebuseo, xkib'iraj rib'iral i xkian i aj Israel. Re' taqe reey re' re' ar wilkeeb' parookb'aal q'iij reh i nim ha' Jordán chupaam taqe i raxchee'. Eh wach k'ixkaab', xponik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i palaw Mediterráneo, xponik Líbano. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taqe i reey re' re' xkiyejaa' wach chi xooj kik'ulb'ilej i Josué, ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj heveo, wilkeeb' Gabaón xkib'iraj rib'iral i xub'an i Josué ruuk' i tinamit Jericó, ruch'ihil i xub'an ruuk' i tinamit Hai. <verse number="4" style="v" />Xkiyejaa' wach kijot'ariik i aj Israel, aj taqareel tii chik taqe xiooj xkian kiib' xkiyeew reje chi riij i kib'uruux q'aah koxtaal, i q'aah koxtaal tz'uhuum xa kojb'al chik wach ye'aab' vino <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh q'aah i kiso' xkikoj reje je' wo' noq i kixijab' xkikoj reje chi kooq, xak'ojb'al chik wach. Eh re' kikaxlanwi'k xkik'am reje reh i kib'eeh xakow chik, eh xaq'uux chik wach. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xi ponik ruuk' i Josué kiyejaam wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat ar Gilgal, je' wili i xkiq'or reh, je' wo' keh chu'nchel i aj Israel:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj chi najt yuuq' qohchalik inqaaj chi wilik i neenqayejaa' taq wach awuuk', inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel je' wili i kichaq'weesjiik i aj heveo xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Ruq'iij ma' najt ta taq ayu' hat patim ¿nik' wach noq inawaaj taq i hat chi wilik i neenqayejaa' taq awach awuuk'?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Gabaón je' wili xkiq'or reh i Josué:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj neerub'an chi nee qoh kahnik taq chi amoso, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' Josué xupahqaaj keh chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">¿Awach taq i hat, aha' taq ti chalik? inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' keh je' wili i ruchaq'weesjiik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj chi najt yuuq' qoh chalik xa ruum xqib'iraj rib'iral chi wilik rajaawriik taq aaDios i hat, eh xa ruum chi xqib'iraj rib'iral i nimaq wach ma' ilooj taj rub'anam taq wuuk' ar Egipto. <verse number="10" style="v" />Xa ruum wo' chi xqib'iraj rib'iral chib'ih i xub'an kuuk' i kiib' chi kireey i aj amorreo chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. Re' Sehón reey ar Hesbón, re' Og reey ar Basán, re' taqe i xi patinik ar Astarot. <verse number="11" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq re' taqe i k'amal qab'eeh taqe i qatinamiit je' wili i xkiq'or cho qeh: Re' taq i hat chak'am taq reje awa' ahaa' reh ab'eeh hiy taq aha' wilkeeb' wii' je' wili taq i neenaq'or keh: Re' hoj inqaaj chi nee qoh kahnik chi kimoso, eh chi wilik inqaaj qayejaam wach kuuk', inki taqe qeh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hoj noq xoj chalik taq chasik'ariik kotz'a' naq i qakaxlanwi'k wili, eh yu'naak kow chik xq'uuxrik chik kiwach. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh je' wo' taqe i qakoxtaal tz'uhuum wili ko ak' naq noq xqanujisaj taqe chaloq chi vino, eh yu'naak xi hopib'ik chik. Eh re' taqe qaso' ruch'ihil taqe i qaxijab' xiq'ahik wo' chik, ar ink'utinik chi najtir inqatoq'aa' cho b'ehik, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe aj Israel xa ruum chi xkilow chi q'ahinaq chik i chib'ih keh taqe re' xkinimaj i xkiq'or, xa re' la' ma' xkipahqaaj ta reh i Dios i naa kianam. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xkiyejaa' wach chi xkik'am kiib' pansuqkiil k'uxliis kuuk' i aj Gabaón. Eh xuq'or keh chi naa kiko'leem riij i kik'achariik. Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel xkiq'or i xti korik chi je' re' i naa kianam i keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh noq ixib' chik q'iij kik'amam kiib' pansuqkiil k'uxliis kuuk' i aj Gabaón re' taqe i aj Israel xkinab'eej chi re' taqe re' xama' najt ta wo' kuuk' wilkeeb' reje i xa kika'jaah wo' taqe. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ruum aj re' paroox q'iij xiooj i aj Israel chi kisik'ariik taqe i aj Gabaón xi ponik chupaam taqe i kitinamiit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Gabaón, Cofira, Beerot, eh re' Quiriat-jearim. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel ma' xkikansaj ta taqe i tinamit re' re', ruum re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel kiq'orom chik korik parub'ihnaal i QaJaaw chi naa kiko'leem riij i kik'achariik taqe re'.</para>
  <para style="p">Ruum aj re', re' taqe i aj Israel xkitoq'aa' kiwech'um riij i ma' holohik taj xkian i k'amal kib'eeh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh je' wili xkiq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj qaq'orom i korik parub'ihnaal i qaDios chi ma' naa ta qakansam taqe. Ruum aj re' yu'naak xama' xta chik i naaqa'nam keh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hoj ma' naa ta qakansam taqe i aj Gabaón ruum wixqakansaj taqe neenqayoj wach i korik qaq'orom ree Dios ruum i re' nee ruyeew chee rujosq'iil chi qanaah, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel ma' xkikansaj ta taqe i aj Gabaón. Xa re' la' xkiq'or chi naa kikahniik chi xa kajsi'wiil taqe, eh chi xa b'ehlan kihaa' chu'nchel i tinamit Israel, je' re' noq re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh xkian wo' hoq aha' wilik i xkiq'or.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' Josué reh xuyuq'eej taqe i aj Gabaón, xupahqaaj keh chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">¿Chib'ih reet noq xachuk taq qeh i q'orik, re' taq i hat xaq'or taq qeh chi najt taq ti chalik, xa nah re' xa ayu' wo' taq hat patim? <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh ruum chi xachuk taqe i q'orik yu'naak xat kahnik taq chi ri'sil i ti' k'axik xat kahnik taq chi moso chi juneliik. Re' taq i hat naa akahniik chi yok'ol reh i sii' chi b'ehlan reh i ha' naa rukamaniik parupaat i nuDios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Gabaón je' wili i chaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj xqachuk i q'orik ruum ma' k'isiin ta xoj yo'jik taq awuum xqakapaaj i hoj chi naa taq kooj akansam. Eh qib'iraj wo' rib'iral chi re' taq aaWaJaaw aaDios taq i hat ruq'orom cho reh i Moisés i raj kamanoom chi naa ruye'em taq aweh chu'nchel i qaye'aab' wili, eh chi naa taq akansam chu'nchel i patineel wilkeeb' chupaam. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh yu'naak panaq'ab' taq chik wilkooj neerub'an chi nee taq i na a'n quuk' nik' wach i ruk'ul inawilow taq i hat, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ma' xuyeew ta q'ab' keh i aj Israel chi xkikansaj taqe i aj Gabaón. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh xikanab'jik chi xa kajsi'wiil, xa b'ehlan kihaa' taqe i tinamit, je' wo' hoq i naa rukamaniik chinaah i ru artaal i QaJaaw Dios, eh i naa rukamaniik chupaam i ye'aab' rusik'im wach i QaJaaw Dios. Eh re' taqe i aj Gabaón je' re' i kikamaj xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' noq xb'aan keh i aj amorreo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' Adonisedec i kireey i aj Jerusaleem xrib'iraj rib'iral chi re' Josué xusach kiwach chi jumpech i tinamit Hai, eh chi xukansaj i kireey, je' rukab' noq rusacham wach i tinamit Jericó, haa' i kireey. Eh xrib'iraj wo' rib'iral chi re' taqe i aj Gabaón, chi xkik'am kiib' pansuqkiil k'uxliis kuuk' i aj Israel. Eh chi wilik chik i wilkeeb' chi kixilak. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' reey re' re' ma' k'isiin ta xchalik ruyo'jiik noq xrib'iraj taqe re', ruum re' tinamit Gabaón nimlaj tinamit wilik rajaawriik chuwach i tinamit Hai. Eh re' taqe i winaq wilkeeb' ar xti q'e' kow kiib'. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' Adonisedec kireey i aj Jerusaleem wilik i xutaq'aaj reje ruq'orariik reh i Hoham kireey i aj Hebrón, je' wo' reh i Piream kireey i aj Jarmut, je' wo' reh i Jafía kireey i aj Laquis, je' wo' reh i Debir kireey i aj Eglón, je' wili xuq'or reje keh: <verse number="4" style="v" />Johteen taq cho wuuk' ayu' kinatow taq chi kipletohjiik taqe i aj Gabaón, ruum, re' keh xi okik chik pansuqkiil k'uxliis ruuk' i Josué, je' wo' kuuk' i chu'nchel i aj Israel, inki. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh xkimol kiib' i ho'oob' chi kireey i aj amorreo, i kireey i aj Jerusaleem, kireey i aj Hebrón, kireey i aj Jarmut, i kireey i aj Loquis, kireey i aj Eglón. Re' keh kiho'cheel kuch'ihil taqe i ki soldado xijohtik johtoq ar, xiooj wih-oq chuwach i kitinamiit i aj Gabaón reh chi naa kianam reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xkib'iraj chi je' re' i wilkeeb' pan tinamit Gabaón xkitaq'aaj ruq'orariik reh i Josué re' kiyejaam wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat ar Gilgal, je' wili xkiq'or reh: Qoh k'oloq ako'leej i hoj, hoj amoso johteen cho chi jumehq'iil reh i qakoljiik, ruum chu'nchel i kireey i aj amorreo patim taqe paraxchee' xkimol cho kiib' chi rub'anariik qeh, inki taqe. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' Josué xelik reje Gilgal ruch'ihil chu'nchel i ru soldado kow kiib'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xq'orarik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios: Re' hat mat yo'jik kuum, ruum re' hin naa taqe nuq'asam panaq'ab', ma' jino'q keh i re' naa kikuyum i peleto awuuk', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' Josué xelik reje Gilgal, chaq'ab' xb'ehik reje, eh chi ma' keht'al taqe i aj amorreo xooj k'oloq chikinaah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xuyeew q'ab' chi ma' k'isiin xiyo'jik taqe i aj amorreo chikiwach i aj Israel, chi je' re', re' Josué ma' k'isiin taqe i aj Gabaón xukansaj. Eh wilik taqe ixrajimaj reje chupaam i ye'aab' Bet-horón, wilik taqe i xukansaj chupaam i ye'aab' Azeca i Maceda. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh noq qajik inki a'n chee aj amorreo panqajik Bet-horón, noq elik inki a'n chikiwach i aj Israel, re' QaJaaw Dios xuqasaj cho pan taxaaj i nimaq taq saqb'och chikinaah. Eh yohb'aal wach k'ihaal i aj amorreo xikimik ruum, ma' xata je' k'ihaal i xkikansaj i aj Israel ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh noq re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj taqe i aj amorreo pan kiq'ab' i aj Israel re' Josué xuq'oreej i QaJaaw Dios chikiwach i tinamit, eh je' wili i xuq'or reh i q'iij, ruch'ihil i poh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Tipahoq i hat q'iij chinaah i tinamit Gabaón,</para>
  <para style="q">tipahoq i hat poh chinaah i k'ixkaab' Ajalón, inki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' q'iij xpa'lojik wo' hoq, je' wo' hoq i poh</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal chik xb'aan keh i aj ixowaal kuum i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">Re' i wili tz'ihb'amaj rehtalil chupaam i ruhuuj i Jaser, re' ruq'or chi je' wili: Re' q'iij k'isiin ma' jinaj q'iij xpahik panyejaal i taxaaj, ma' xokik ta chik qohoq chi jumehq'iil, inki. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' rupahiik i q'iij re' re' ma' jank'al ta nilarik cho pampeet, eh ma' jank'al ta wo' inilarik koq'uun. Re' noq i xb'irjik chee jinaj i winaq ruum i QaJaaw Dios. Re' QaJaaw Dios xuko'leej taqe i aj Israel chikiwach i aj ixowaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil chu'nchel i aj Israel xi sutinik chaloq ar Gilgal re' i kiyejaam wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i ho'oob' chi reey xkimol chi elik xooj kikeb'aa' kiib' chupaam i jinaj i jul wilik ar Maceda. <verse number="17" style="v" />Xa re' la' wilik i jinaj x-ilwik keh chi ar kikeb'aa' kiib' chupaam i paat ab'aj, eh xuq'or reh i Josué. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' reh je' wili i xuq'or keh i ru soldado: Re' taq i hat cha tolej taq chee nimaq ab'aj nee taq inatz'ap i koq chii' i jul chi korik, eh nee taq inakoj cha'jen reh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' taq i hat maa cham taq awiib' ayu', hiy taq chi kajimjiik taqe i aj ixowaal chikiij taq ti okoq reje. Eh maayeew taq chik q'ab' keh chi neekisutinik cho pan kitinamiit ruum re' taq aaWaJaaw aaDios taq i hat xuq'asaj taq chik panaq'ab' taqe i re', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh noq re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel xkiq'at wach chi jumpech taqe i aj amorreo ma' k'isiin keh i xikimik. Eh re' taqe i aj amorreo xi kahnik chi kok'achalkeeb' xkikeb'aa' kiib' chupaam taqe tinamiit kotimaj kiij chi tz'aq. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' i tinamit Israel manlik kiwach suq kik'ux noq xi sutinik cho ruuk' i Josué re' kiyejaam wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat ar Maceda. Re' naq i wilik wii' i Josué, ma' jino'q i ma' holohik ta kiq'orik chikiij i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué: Cha teh taq chii' i paat ab'aj re' re' chawesaj taq cho ar taqe i ho'oob' chi reey, inki. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aha' wilik i xq'orarik keh xkian wo' hoq xkesaj wo' chaloq pampaat ab'aj i ho'oob' chi reey. Re' kireey i aj Jerusaleem, re' kireey i aj Hebrón, re' kireey i aj Jarmut, re' kireey i aj Laquis, re' kireey i aj Eglón. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh noq xi k'amarik reje chuwach i Josué, re' reh xuyuq'eej taqe chu'nchel i winaq k'amal kib'eeh soldado wilkeeb' chi riij je' wili i xuq'or keh: Yu'naak taq i hat chayeq' taq i kalaq taqe i ho'oob' chi reey re' re', inki, eh re' taqe i winaq re' re' i xkian aha' wilik i xq'orarik keh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué: Re' taq i hat mat yo'jik taq kuum maayoj taq ak'ux chakowej taq ak'ux, eh korik-oq taq aweh i cha a'n, ruum re' QaJaaw Dios je' re' naa rub'anam keh chu'nchel i ki-ixowanik taq awach, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' Josué xuq'or chi xit'uyub'jik taqe nah q'ab' chee' i ho'oob' chi reey korehtaal xikimik ar xi kahnik chi t'uyulkeeb' korehtaal xokik i q'iij. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh noq ach k'isiin ma' nokik qohoq i q'iij re' Josué xutaq'aaj kiqahteesjiik nah q'ab' chee' taqe i reey re' re'. Eh xuq'or wo' hoq chi naa wo' chik kiminariik i koq chupaam i paat ab'aj, xkikeb'aa' wii' kiib'. Eh xkitz'ap wo' chik i koq chii' i paat ab'aj ruuk' i nimaq ab'aj, eh ar xi kahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado xa chupaam wo' q'iij re' re' xuchop naah i tinamit Maceda xkisach wach chi jumpech, eh xkuxik kisacham wach ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i patim chupaam. Eh xub'an ruuk' i wilik chi reyil ar je' rukab' i xub'an ruuk' i kireey i aj Jericó.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh noq re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel kisacham chik wach i tinamit Maceda ar chik xiooj q'aq'ineel pan tinamit Libna, re' chik i re' xkian reh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj wo' tinamit re' re' pan kiq'ab' i aj Israel, ruch'ihil i kireey. Eh xkuxik kikansam chi q'aslaj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' re' re', xkian ruuk' i kireey i aj Libna, je' rukab' xkian ruuk' i kireey i aj Jericó.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel xi elik reje Libna ar chik xiooj chi q'aq'inik chupaam i tinamit Laquis, ar xkiyejaa' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat chuwach i tinamit re' re'. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj wo' pan kiq'ab' i aj Israel i tinamit Laquis, eh chi junwaar xkichop naah xkuxik kikansam chi q'aslaj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i wilik kik'achariik wilkeeb' chupaam. Xkian ruuk' i tinamit re' re' je' rukab' i xkian ruuk' i tinamit Libna. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh re' Horam i kireey i aj Gezer ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado xchalik chi ruko'ljiik i tinamit Laquis, xa re' la' xkuxik kikanteesjiik ruum i Josué ma' jino'q chik i xukanaa' chi k'achalkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil i aj Israel xi elik Laquis ar chik xiooj chi q'aq'inik chupaam i tinamit Eglón, ar kiyejaa' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat ma' najt ta ruuk'. <verse number="35" style="v" />Eh chupaam wo' q'iij re' re' xkichop naah i xkuxik kikansam ruuk' qas laj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i wilik kik'achariik wilkeeb' ar, je' rukab' i xkian reh i tinamit Laquis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel noq xi elik reje Eglón ar chik xiooj chi q'aq'inik chupaam i tinamit Hebrón. <verse number="37" style="v" />Eh xkichop naah i tinamit re' re' xkikansaj ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' i wilik chi reyil ar, je' wo' hoq i tinamit. Eh je' wo' re' i xkian reh chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam kok' tinamit wilkeeb' ar. Eh ma' jino'q i xkikanaa' chi k'achalkeeb', je' rukab' i xkian reh i tinamit Eglón.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel noq xi elik reje Hebrón ar chik xiooj chi q'aq'inik chupaam i tinamit Debir. <verse number="39" style="v" />Eh re' i wilik chi reyil ar, chu'nchel i rutinamiit, xkuxik kikansam ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch', je' wo' chu'nchel i tinamit wilik chi kijunsuut, ma' jino'q chik i xkikanaa'. Eh nik' wach i xkian reh taqe i aj Hebrón, i aj Libna, ruch'ihil i wilik chi reyil ar, je' wo' chik re' inki a'n reh taqe i aj Debir ruch'ihil i wilik chi reyil ar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eh re' Josué, re' taqe i aj Israel xkichop naah chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i raxchee' wilkeeb' paruyuq'ul i Neguev, taqe i wilkeeb' wach k'ixkaab', taqe i wilkeeb' wataq salik, ruch'ihil taqe i kireey. Eh kuxik kisacham wach, ma' jino'q chik i xkikanaa', xkian wo' hoq je' rukab' i ruq'orom i ki Dios. <verse number="41" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel kehchaaj chu'nchel i ye'aab' Cades-barnea, koxponik chupaam i ye'aab' Gaza. Eh je' wo' hoq i ye'aab' Gosén koxponik chupaam i ye'aab' Gabaón. <verse number="42" style="v" />Chupaam i q'aq'inik re' re', re' Josué xukansaj taqe chu'nchel i reey ruum re' QaJaaw Dios xtoob'inik keh i aj Israel. <verse number="43" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe chu'nchel i aj Israel xi sutinik wo' chik cho Gilgal re' i ye'aab' kiyejaam wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj Israel xkian reh i tinamit xkimol kiib' chi pleto kuuk'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq xrib'iraj rib'iral i xkian i aj Israel i Jabín wilik chi reyil Hazor, xutaq'aaj ruq'orariik reh i Jobab wilik chi reyil Madón, eh reh i wilik chi reyil Simrón, reh i wilik chi reyil Acsaf. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' Jabín xutaq'aaj ruq'orariik keh i reey wilkeeb' pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij chupaam taqe i raxchee' wilik wii' i palaw kineret. Eh je' wo' keh i reey wilkeeb' pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij chupaam i ye'aab' Arabá keh taqe reey wilkeeb' wataq k'ixkaab' parookb'aal q'iij paruyuq'ul i Dor. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh xutaq'aaj wo' ruq'orariik keh i aj cananeo wilkeeb' reje parelb'aal q'iij, eh wilkeeb' reje parookb'aal q'iij, je' wo' keh i aj amorreo taqe i aj heveo, taqe i aj ferezeo, taqe i aj jebuseo, wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i rax chee' taqe i aj heveo wilkeeb' waraa' i yuuq' Hermón ar Mizpa. <verse number="4" style="v" />Chi kunchelaal taqe re' xkian jinaj wach kik'ux xkimol cho kiib' kuch'ihil taqe i ki soldado, je' kik'ihaal i saniib' tub'lik chi chii' i palaw. Eh yohb'aal wo' wach k'ihaal i kikareta i kikawayu reh q'aq'inik xkik'am chaloq. <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu'nchel i reey re' re' xkimol cho kiib' jinaj xkimol wii' kiib', ar kiyejaa' kiperpat chi chii' i runimaal ha' Merom, reh chi naa kokiik chi q'aq'inik kuuk' i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Re' hat mat yo'jik kuum taqe re', ruum je' yu' i ora i iqal kamnaq chik taqe chawach ruum re' hin naa nuq'asaniik taq panaq'ab'. Re' taq i hat naa taq atoqib'eem i rooq i kikawayu, eh naa taq ak'atam i kikareta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado xiooj k'oloq chi chii' i nim ha' Merom xiooj k'oloq chikinaah chi q'aq'inik chikinaah xa chi ma' keht'al. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj pan kiq'ab' i aj Israel taqe i aj ixowaal reh chi xkian reh xkajimaj chaloq korehtaal xi k'ulik kahnoq pan tinamit Sidón. Eh xi ponik chupaam i ye'aab' Misrefot-maim xi ponik wach k'ixkaab' Mizpa wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij, xkuxik kikansam. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xub'an wo' kuuk' i aj ixowaal re' re' je' rukab' i xq'orarik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios xitoqib'eej rooq' i kikawayu, eh xkuxik ruk'atam i kikareta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chi riij i re', re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado xi chalik chi q'aq'inik chupaam i tinamit Hazor re' i xkimol wii' kiib' i aj ixowaal xkikansaj wo' hoq i wilik chi reyil ar. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh xkuxik wo' kikansam chu'nchel i patim taqe ar, xkisach wach chi jumpech, xkik'at i tinamit. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh xkisach wo' wach i k'ih seht chi tinamit xkian jinaj wach kik'ux chi rixowjiik kiwach i aj Israel xkichop naah. Eh xkikansaj chu'nchel i tinamit, je' wo' taqe i wilkeeb' chi reyil, je' rukab' i xuq'or i Moisés raj kamanoom i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel ma' jino'q i tinamit wilkeeb' chinaah taqe i rub'ohl yuuq' xkik'at xa re' wo' hoq i tinamit Hazor xkik'at. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh xkuxik kikansam ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' chu'nchel i patim taqe chupaam taqe i tinamit re' re' ma' jino'q chik i xkikanaa' chi k'achalkeeb'. Eh xkichop naah taqe i chikop wilkeeb' ar je' wo' chu'nchel i xa chib'ih jariik wilkeeb' ar.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xub'an taqe i xq'orarik reh ruum i Moisés</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'or reh i Moisés re' raj kamanoom chib'ih i naa rub'anam, eh re' Moisés xuq'or wo' kahnoq reh i Josué. Eh re' i Josué xub'an wo' hoq chu'nchel, ma' jino'q i xukanaa' chi ma' xub'an taj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xkichop naah chu'nchel i ye'aab' wilkeeb' paraxchee' chu'nchel i ye'aab' Neguev. Eh xkichop wo' naah chu'nchel i ye'aab' Gosén, je' wo' hoq i wataq k'ixkaab' Arabá, je' wo' taqe i raxchee' ruch'ihil i wataq k'ixkaab' Israel. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' ye'aab' xkichop naah ar tohq'ik chaloq chupaam i wilik wii' i yuuq' Halac, re' wilik wii' i ye'aab' Seir, eh imponik ko Baal-gad wilik wataq k'ixkaab' Líbano ma' naj ta ruuk' i yuuq' Hermón. Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xkichop taqe i reey wilkeeb' ar, eh xkikansaj taqe. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' Josué najt xkian i q'aq'inik kuuk' taqe i reey re' re'. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' i xkik'am kiib' pansuqkiil k'uxliis kuuk' i aj Israel xa re' wo' taqe i aj heveo, re' i wilkeeb' ar Gabaón. Eh chu'nchel chik taqe i tinamit ruuk' q'aq'inik xkichop naah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xukowb'isaj i kánima taqe i aj ixowaal wilkeeb' Canaán, xa re' raaj i reh chi xkian i peleto i aj Israel kuuk', korehtaal xsacharik kiwach chi kunchelaal kuum i aj Israel. Re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'or wo' cho reh i Moisés chi ma' naa ta ruketelaam kiwach chi korehtaal kikanteesjik chi kunchelaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel chupaam taqe i q'iij re' re' xkisach wach chi jumpech xkichop naah i kitinamiit i riih rumaam Anac. Re' i wilkeeb' chinaah i yuuq' Hebrón, re' i ye'aab' Debir, eh je' wo' ar Anab, je' wo' hoq i wilkeeb' chinaah taqe i yuuq' wilkeeb' Judá, i wilkeeb' Israel. <verse number="22" style="v" />Je' re' noq ma' jino'q chik i riih rumaam i nimlaj winaq Anac xkahnik chupaam i ruyuq'ul i Israel xa paruyuq'ul chik Gaza, chupaam i ye'aab' Gat, i ye'aab' Asdod chik xi kahnik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel xkichop naah chu'nchel i ye'aab', nik' wach rub'aan xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés je' wo' re' rub'aan xkian. Eh xuch'aq wo' hoq i ye'aab' Canaán keh i kab'laj ch'uq chi aj Israel, eh ma' xwihik ta chik q'aq'inik chupaam i ye'aab' re' re'.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Moisés ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel i xkian reh taqe reey wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' Moisés ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel re' taqe i reey wili xkian reh re' taqe i wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i ye'aab' chi juntar chee nim ha' Jordán parelb'aal q'iij reje xtohq'ik reje chi chii' i nim ha' Arnón xponik ko waraa' i yuuq' Hermón, eh chu'nchel i ye'aab' Arabá imponik chucheel reje ireelb'aalq'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' Sehón kireey i aj amorreo patim naq Hesbón, re' ye'aab' ruchopom naah imponik ko Aroer, chi chii' i nim ha' Arnón, imponik kopanyejaal i k'ixkaab' ko chi chii' i nim ha' Jaboc, eh xponik ko aha' rutoq'aa' cho wii' i kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam i Amón, imponik panyejaal i ye'aab' Galaad. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh i ruchop wo' naah haa' i wach k'ixkaab' wilik parookb'aal q'iij reje reh i nim ha' Jordán. Ar intohq'ik reje chi chii' i palaw Ceneret, eh imponik ko chi chii' i kamnaq palaw, imponik panyejaal i ruyuq'ul i tinamit Bet-jesimot, re' wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij re' wilik wii' i yuuq' Pisga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xkian wo' reh i Og wilik chi reyil ar Basán re' re' kik'ulik i xi chalik chupaam i ye'aab' Refaim. Re' Og xpatinik ar Astarot, eh ar Edrei. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh rub'an wo' taaq'anik chinaah i ye'aab' intohq'ik reje ruuk' i yuuq' Hermón, imponik ko chupaam i ye'aab' Salca, eh chu'nchel i ye'aab' Basán. Eh imponik kopan k'ula't reh i ye'aab' Gesur, eh re' Maaca imponik panyejaal i ye'aab' Galaad ruchopom naq naah i Sehón wilik naq chi reyil Hesbón.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' Moisés ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel xkian reh taqe i re'. Eh re' Moisés xuyeew taqe i ye'aab' re' re' keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén, ruch'ihil i riih rumaam i Gat, je' wo' hoq i yejaal i ch'uq i riih rumaam i Manasés.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel xkian reh i reey wilkeeb' chi juntar reje i nim ha' Jordán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel re' taqe i reey wili xkian reh re' wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i ye'aab' chi juntar chaloq i nim ha' Jordán parookb'aal reje i q'iij. Ar xtohq'ik reje chupaam i tinamit Baal-gad, wach k'ixkaab' Líbano, eh ruuk' i yuuq' Halac imponik ruuk' i ye'aab' Seir. Eh chu'nchel i ye'aab' xkichop naah i Josué xuch'aq keh i chi kich'uhqaal i aj Israel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' wilik paraxchee', re' i wach k'ixkaab' Jordán, re' taqe i wach salik reje ruuk' i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. Eh re' taqe ye'aab' Neguev. Eh re' taqe ye'aab' re' re' keh naq taqe i aj heteo, taqe aj amorreo, taqe aj cananeo, taqe aj ferezeo, taqe i aj heveo, taqe i aj jebuseo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i reey xkisach wach re' taqe wili: Re' i reey ar Jericó, re' reey ar Hai wilik ma' najt ta ruuk' i Bet-el; <verse number="10" style="v" />re' reey ar Jerusaleem, re' reey ar Hebrón, <verse number="11" style="v" />re' reey ar Jarmut, re' reey ar Laquis, <verse number="12" style="v" />re' reey ar Eglón, re' reey ar Gezer, <verse number="13" style="v" />re' reey ar Debir, re' reey ar Geder, <verse number="14" style="v" />re' reey ar Horma, re' reey ar Arad, <verse number="15" style="v" />re' reey ar Libna, re' reey ar Adulam, <verse number="16" style="v" />re' reey ar Maceda, re' reey ar Bet-el, <verse number="17" style="v" />re' reey ar Tapúa, re' reey ar Hefer, <verse number="18" style="v" />re' reey ar Afec, re' reey ar Sarón, <verse number="19" style="v" />re' reey ar Madón, re' reey ar Hazor, <verse number="20" style="v" />re' reey ar Simron-merón, re' reey ar Acsaf, <verse number="21" style="v" />re' reey ar Taanac, re' reey ar Maguido, <verse number="22" style="v" />re' reey ar Cedes, re' reey ar Jacneam, re' wilik paruyuq'ul i Carmelo, <verse number="23" style="v" />re' reey ar Dor, re' reey ar pan tinamit Goim, re' wilik ar Gilgal. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' reey ar Tirsa, junlaj ru ka'winaq chi reey chu'nchel i xkisach wach i Josué ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ko wilik naq i ye'aab' komajaa' inkichop nah i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq riji' winaq chik i Josué, je' wili i xq'orarik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios: Re' hat k'ih chik aha'b'ul xanaah re' kook'ih i ye'aab' majaa' ta inkichop naah i aj Israel. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kox kahnik i kiye'aab' taqe i aj filisteo, je' wo' hoq i kiye'aab' taqe i aj gesureos. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ar intohq'ik chi chii' i nim ha' Sihor pareelb'aal q'iij reh i Egipto. Eh imponik kopan k'ula't reh i tinamit Ecrón re' wilik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij re' inkiq'or chi keh i aj cananeo. Eh chupaam taqe ye'aab' re' re' wilkeeb' i ho'oob' chi reey re' kitaaq'anik chikinaah i aj filisteo re' taqe i wilkeeb' ar Gaza, eh ar Asdod, Ascalón, Ecrón, aveos. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh pansak'aaj reje i rookb'aal q'iij chu'nchel i kiye'aab' i aj cananeo, i ye'aab' Mehara, i kiye'aab' i aj Sidón i nik'ik ponoq Afec, eh imponik kopan kik'ula't i aj amorreo. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh i kiye'aab' i aj giblitas, haa' i ye'aab' Líbano i wilik reje pareelb'aal q'iij, eh imponik pan tinamit Baal-gad imponik chinaah i yuuq' Hermón, eh imponik panookb'al reh i tinamit Hamat. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hin naa wesaniik reje keh chu'nchel i patim paraxchee' ar intohq'ik reje Líbano, inik'ik ponoq Misrefot-maim, i wilkeeb' Sidón. Xa re' la' re' taqe i ye'aab' re' re' koruman chi naa asik'im chi riij noq naa ach'aqam keh i aj Israel, naa wo' a'nam je' rukab' i nuq'orom aweh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' re' re' naa taq ach'aqam keh i b'elejeeb' ch'uq chi aj Israel, eh keh wo' hoq i yejaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam Manasés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén ruch'ihil i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq i riih rumaam i Manasés, xkik'ulum chik i kiye'aab' noq ch'aqarik keh ruum i Moisés parelb'aal reje q'iij reh i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh ar intohq'ik reje paruyuq'ul Aroer imponik ko chi chii' i nim ha' Arnón ree tinamit wilik panyejaal k'ixkaab'. Chu'nchel i k'ixkaab' Medeba imponik chupaam i ye'aab' Dibón. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh xuch'aq wo' haa' chu'nchel i tinamit ruchopom naah i Sehón re' kireey taqe i aj amorreo patim ar Hesbón korehtaal xponik ko paruk'ula't i kiye'aab' i aj amonita. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh haa' i ye'aab' Galaad, re' kiye'aab' i aj gesureo, je' wo' kiye'aab' i aj Maacateo, haa' i yuuq' Hermón, je' wo' chu'nchel i ye'aab' Basán xponik Salca. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh haa' i ye'aab' ruchopom naah i Og reey ar Basán, re' imb'anik i taaq'anik Astarot, eh ar Edrei. Eh re' Og re' re' jinaj keh aj refaita re' xuko'leej riib' noq re' Moisés xub'an reh noq xehteesjik reje chupaam i ye'aab' re' re'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Xa re' wo' chik taqe i riih rumaam i Gesur ruch'ihil i riih rumaam i Maaca, ma' xi ehteesjik ta pan kiye'aab' kuum i aj Israel. Xi kahnik la' chi k'acharik chi kixilak, ar xi kahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i ye'aab' xuch'aq i Moisés</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Leví i ma' xye'arik ta kiye'aab' ruum i Moisés ruum re' taqe re' jilow taqe mayiij chuwach i kaJaaw ki Dios i aj Israel, je' rukab' i q'orooj cho keh ruum i reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' Moisés xuch'aq wo' kiye'aab' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén re' q'oreel jarub' chi kiib' i awach reh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' kiye'aab' xponik ko chupaam i ye'aab' Aroer, chi chii' i nim ha' Arnón, xponik i wilkeeb' wii' i tinamit panyejaal k'ixkaab', je' wo' wach k'ixkaab' Medeba. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh xponik chupaam i ye'aab' Hesbón, je' wo' chu'nchel i tinamit wilik wach k'ixkaab' Dibón, i ar Bamot-baal, i Bet-baal-meón. <verse number="18" style="v" />Je' wo' taqe i ye'aab' Jahaza, i Cademot, i Mefáat, <verse number="19" style="v" />eh ch'aqarik wo' keh i ye'aab' Quiriataim, Sibma, i Zaret-sahar, re' i yuuq' wilik reje chi chii' i k'ixkaab'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ch'aqarik wo' keh i Bet-peor, i Bet-jesimot, eh re' i haa' i wach salik chupaam i ruyuq'ul i Pisga. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh ch'aqarik wo' keh chu'nchel i ye'aab' wach k'ixkaab', je' wo' ye'aab' ruchopom naah i Sehón re' i kireey taqe i aj amorreo, re' xwihik cho chi reyil Hesbón. Re' Moisés xub'an reh i Sehón, re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh re' taqe i raj kamanoom ar Madián re' taqe i wili: Re' Evi, re' Requema, re' Zur, re' Hur, eh re' i Reba. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel ma' k'isiin i tinamit xkikansaj chi kixilak taqe re' ha' i Balaam re' aj q'iij i rak'uun i Beor. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' xch'aqarik keh i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén imponik ko chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. Re' i tinamit re' re' ruch'ihil taqe i kok' ye'aab' pantaq ab'iix xye'arik keh re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' Moisés xuch'aq wo' keh i ye'aab' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Gad re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' ye'aab' xch'aqarik keh taqe i re', re' i Jazer, eh chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' paruyuq'ul i Galaad, eh haa' i yejaal i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Amón imponik ko Aroer, re' wilik chi k'ulwaach Rabá. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh haa' i ye'aab' intohq'ik reje Hesbón, xponik Ramatmizpa imponik Betonim, eh xtohq'ik reje Mahanaim, eh xponik kopan k'ula't ruuk' i ye'aab' Debir. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh haa' i wach k'ixkaab' Bet-arom ruch'ihil i Bet-nimra, i tinamit Sucot, ruch'ihil i Zafón, i ruqox i tinamit ruchopom naah i Sehón reey ar Esbón. Eh imponik chi chii' i palaw kineret wilik pantz'eet reh ireelb'aalq'iij chi juntar i nim ha', eh imponik panreelb'aal q'iij, reh i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit re' re', ruch'ihil taqe i ye'aab' panab'iix xye'arik keh i riih rumaam Gad, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh re' Moisés xuch'aq keh i ye'aab' i yejaal i riih rumaam i Manasés, re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib' chi kitzuhb'aal. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' ye'aab' xye'arik keh ar intohq'ik reje chupaam i tinamit Mahanaim, chu'nchel i ye'aab' Basán, eh chu'nchel i ye'aab' ruchopom naah i Og reey ar Basán, chu'nchel i ye'aab' panab'iix wilik paruyuq'ul i Jair. Oxk'ahl seht chi tinamit. <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh xye'arik wo' keh i yejaal i ye'aab' i Galaad, haa' i tinamit Astarot, i tinamit Edrei, chu'nchel i ye'aab' re' re' xye'arik keh i yejaal i junch'uq i riih rumaam i Maquir, riih rumaam i Manasés, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' Moisés xuch'aq keh i aj Israel chu'nchel i wach k'ixkaab' Moab, re' wilik reje pareelb'aal q'iij chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán, wilik chi k'ulwaach i tinamit Jericó. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh re' Moisés ma' xuyeew ta kiye'aab' i riih rumaam Leví, xa je' la' wili i xuq'or keh: Re' i rukamaj i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel naa taq rukamaniik chi akooch, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xuch'aq i ye'aab' Canaán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' ye'aab' Canaán xch'aqarik keh i aj Israel ruum i Eliazar, k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij ruch'ihil i Josué rak'uun i Nun, kuch'ihil taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' taqe ye'aab' re' re' koxkisik' chi riij noq ch'aqarik keh i b'elejeeb' ch'uq ruuk' i yejaal ch'uq chi aj Israel, je' rukab' i ruq'orom QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés, chi naa rub'anam. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' Moisés ruch'aqam wo' chik i ye'aab' chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán keh i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Gad, i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam Manasés. Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam Leví ma' xkiyeew ta kiye'aab'. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe xikin riih rumaam José ka'ch'uq taqe, re' taqe i riih rumaam Manasés, eh re' taqe riih rumaam Efraín. Eh re' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Leví ma' xkiyeew ta ruye'aab', xa re' wo' xye'arik keh i xi patinik wii' pan tinamit ruch'ihil i ye'aab' i kichikoop. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkich'aq wo' hoq i ye'aab' chi je' re' rukab' i ruq'orom chaloq i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ye'aab' Hebrón xch'aqarik reh i Caleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh pan jinaj q'iij re' taqe i riih rumaam i Judá xiooj ar Gilgal chuq'orob'jiik i Josué, eh re' Caleb i rak'uun i Jefone, Kenezar i rutinamiit, je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: Re' hat aweht'al chib'ih jariik i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés re' i raj kamanoom ar Cades-barnea chawiij i hat, je' wo' chi wiij i hin. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin ka'winaq haab' naq i wilik weh noq wilkooj ar Cades-barnea, re' noq xirutaq'aaj chaloq i Moisés chi rilariik nik' wach noq wilik i ye'aab' Canaán, eh noq ximponik xnuq'or wo' hoq i korik nik' wach noq wilik i ye'aab'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe i xi k'ulik chi wiij chutahariik i ye'aab' re' re' xkiyohb'isaj i tinamit ruuk' i xponik kiq'or chi riij i ye'aab'. Eh re' hin xnuq'or i korik aha' wilik i xraaj i waJaaw i nuDios. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re', re' Moisés je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' ye'aab' xat ik'ik wii' naa rukahniik chi aweh chi juneliik. Eh naa wo' rukahniik chi keh awiih aamaam ruum chi xa a'n aha' wilik i xuq'or aweh i waJaaw i nuDios, inki. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' wili hoob' roxk'ahl haab' chik ruq'orom chaloq i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés, re' noq k'ahchi' cho kik'ik i aj Israel chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. Eh ruum i wilik i ruq'orom rib'iral weh kok'ahchi' ruye'em cho nuk'achariik yu'naak. Re' hin kajwinaq haab' chik ruuk' hoob' haab' i wilik weh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh yu'naak xa ko hin wo' kow inwik'raaj wiib', xa ko je' wo' rukab' noq xirutaq'aaj chee Moisés chi rutahariik i ye'aab' Canaán, xa ko hin wo' kow reh ojik chi q'aq'inik, xa konee wo' kinooj aha' pa' inwaaj ojik panuk'ux i hin. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chayeew tii weh i ye'aab' rax chee' wach re' i ruq'orom rib'iral weh i QaJaaw Dios. Re' hat aweht'al chi xawilkeeb' wo' chi patinik chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' taqe riih rumaam i nimlaj winaq Anac, nimaq i kitinamiit kotimaj kiij chi tz'aq. Re' hin re' Dios neentoob'inik weh chi kehteesjiik reje ar, je' rukab' i ruq'orom weh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i Josué je' wili i xuq'or reh i Caleb rak'uun i Jefone: Re' ta naq i QaJaaw Dios neentoob'inik aweh, inki. Eh xuyeew wo' reh i ye'aab' Hebrón. <verse number="14" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq re' i ye'aab' Hebrón xkahnik chi reh i Caleb, je' wo' keh taqe i riih rumaam, eh xkahnik chi keh chi jumpech. Je' re' i xb'aan ruuk' i Caleb ruum xub'an i xq'orarik reh ruum i kaJaaw i ki Dios i aj Israel. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' naq i rub'ihnaal cho pampeet i ye'aab' Hebrón Quiriat-arba re' i b'ihnaal Arba re' ruuk' taqe i rumaam rati't i nimlaj winaq Anac.</para>
  <para style="p">Chi riij i re' xwihik i suq laj k'acharik chupaam i ye'aab' re' re'.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ye'aab' wili xye'arik keh i riih rumaam Judá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' wili xye'arik keh i riih rumaam i Judá, noq kisik'im chik chi riij re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal. Ar i tohq'ik reje pank'ula't ruuk' i ye'aab' Edom, imponik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' reh i ye'aab' Zin. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i k'ula't re' re' imponik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij reh i kamnaq palaw. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij imponik i wilik wii' i yuuq' Acrabim, inik'ik reje panchiq yuuq' wilik ar Zin. Eh i nik'ik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i ye'aab' Cades-barnea, eh i nik'ik ponoq Hezrón, injohtik johtoq Adar, eh imponik sutinoq ar Carca. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh inik'ik ponoq Asmón, inooj eloq chi chii' i nim ha' inchalik Egipto, ar inooj kuxoq chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo inooj kuxoq i k'ula't wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' i ruk'ula'tiil i chii' parelb'aal reje q'iij re' i chii' i kamnaq palaw imponik inokik wii' i nim ha' Jordán. Eh ar intohq'ik reje i ruk'ula'tiil i chii' i wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh injohtik johtoq chupaam i ye'aab' Bet-hogla, inik'ik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i ye'aab' Bet-arabá, eh inooj i wilik wii' i paat ab'aj Bohán ruye'aab' i rak'uun i Rubén. <verse number="7" style="v" />Chi riij i re' inik'ik reje i wilik wii' i ye'aab' Debir ar wach k'ixkaab' Acor, imponik sutinoq chupaam i ye'aab' Gilgal wilik chi k'ul wach i yuuq' Adumín, pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i nim ha'. Re' k'ula't i nik'ik ponoq i wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' En-semes rub'ihnaal, eh inooj eloq i wilik wii' i nim ha' Rogel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh inik'ik ponoq wach k'ixkaab' Ben-hinom pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i ye'aab' jebuseo, re' wo' hoq i Jerusaleem. Chi riij i re' inik'ik ponoq chinaah i yuuq' chi k'ul wach i k'ixkaab' Hinom wilik reje parookb'aal q'iij, eh pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i ye'aab' Refaim. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' k'ula't re' re' imponik sutinoq kochinaah i yuuq' imponik i wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' wilik Neftoa. Eh imponik chupaam taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chinaah i yuuq' Efrón, inik'ik ponoq chupaam i ye'aab' Baala, eh Quiriat-jearim wo' inkiq'or reh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh Baala imponik sutinoq i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' re' re' inooj reje chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij chinaah i yuuq' Seir, inik'ik chucheel i yuuq' Jearim. Eh imponik Quesolón wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij imponik Bet-semes, eh inik'ik pan tinamit Timna. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i ye'aab' re' re' pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, intohq'ik chaloq chinaah i yuuq' Ecrón, inooj reje Sicrón, xik'ik chinaah i yuuq' Baala, xik'ik wo' ponoq Jabneel. Eh ko ar xooj kuxoq wach chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' re' re' pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij re' i palaw Mediterráneo. Re' taqe wili i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' xch'aqarik keh i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Judá re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib'.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Caleb rehchaaj i ye'aab' Hebrón, i ye'aab' Debir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i Josué xuyeew ruye'aab' i Caleb rak'uun i Jefone chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Judá, je' rukab' xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Josué. Re' ye'aab' xye'arik reh re' i Quiriat-arba, eh Hebrón wo' inkiq'or reh, re' i kitinamiit i riih rumaam nimlaj winaq Anac rub'ihnaal. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' Caleb xresaj taqe chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' ixib' chi rak'uun i Anac, je' wili i kib'ihnaal: Sesai, Ahimán, Talmai. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq rehchaaj i ye'aab' re' re' xooj wo' chi rehtesjiik taqe i wilkeeb' Debir. Re' tinamit Debir Quiriat-sefer i b'ih inkiq'or cho najtir. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' Caleb je' wili i xuq'or: Awach i nenooj chi q'aq'inik, eh nee ruchop naah i tinamit Quiriat-sefer, re' hin neenuyeew chi rehk'een i wixq'uun Acsa rub'ihnaal, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i tinamit re' re', re' Otoniel xchopwik naah rak'uun i Cenaz ruchaaq wo' i Caleb, eh xuyeew wo' chi rehk'een i Otoniel i rixq'uun Acsa i rub'ihnaal. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq ojik chik inki a'n pankipaat re' Otoniel xuq'or reh i Acsa chi chupahqaaj reh i rajaaw chi ye'aroq ruye'aab' tikb'al chib'ih reh. Re' i Acsa xqajik chi riij i b'uurux. Eh re' i Caleb xupahqaaj reh i rixq'uun chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">Chib'ih naq inawaaj inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' reh je' wili xuq'or: Re' hin weht'al chi xayeew chik weh i chiq yuuq' Neguev, xa re' la' inwaaj wo' chik nee nayeew weh i ye'aab' wilik wii' i k'achlik ha', inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' Caleb xuyeew wo' keh i ye'aab' wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' taxaaj je' wo' hoq i wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' panyuuq'.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i tinamit wili xkehchaaj i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Judá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit wili xkehchaaj i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Judá nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit xkehchaaj pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij pank'ula't reje ruuk' i Edom je' wili kib'ihnaal: Cabseel, Edar, Jagur. <verse number="22" style="v" />Cina, Dimona, Adada, <verse number="23" style="v" />Cedes, Hazor, Itnán, <verse number="24" style="v" />Zif, Telem, Bealot, <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor-hadata, Queriot, Hezrón Hazor i rukab' b'ih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Sema, Molada, <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-gada, Hesmón, Bet-pelet, <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar-sual, Beerseba, Bizotia, <verse number="29" style="v" />Baala, Lim, Esem, <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Quesil, Horma, <verse number="31" style="v" />Siclag, Madmana, Sansana, <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaot, Silhim, Aín, Rimón, b'elejeeb' ru ka'winaq chu'nchel i tinamit xkehchaaj, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i tinamit xkehchaaj i wach k'ixkaab' je' wili kib'ihnaal: Estaol, Zora, Asena, <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoa, En-ganim, Tapúa, Enam, <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmut, Adulam, Soco, Azeca, <verse number="36" style="v" />Saaraim, Aditaim, Gedera, Gederotaim, kajlaj taqe chi tinamit chu'nchel, haa' taqe kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenán, Hadasa, Migdal-gad, <verse number="38" style="v" />Dileán, Mizpa, Jocteel, <verse number="39" style="v" />Loquis, Boscat, Eglón, <verse number="40" style="v" />Cabón, Lohmam, Quitlis, <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederot, Bet-dagón, Naama, Maceda, waqlaj taqe chi tinamit chu'nchel, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Re' re' taqe i tinamit Libna, Eter, Asán, <verse number="43" style="v" />Jifta, Asena, Nezib. <verse number="44" style="v" />Keila, Aczib, Maresá, b'elejeeb' taqe chi tinamit chu'nchel, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Eh haa' i tinamit Ecrón, haa' taqe i kok' tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel. <verse number="46" style="v" />Ar intohq'ik cho Ecrón imponik ko chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, eh haa' chu'nchel i tinamit wilik chuka'jaah i tinamit Asdod, haa' i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Eh haa' tinamit Asdod, i kok' tinamit, haa' i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel, haa' i tinamit Gaza, haa' taqe kok' tinamit i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel. Eh xponik chi chii' i nim ha' inchalik Egipto, xponik chi chii' i nimlaj palaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Eh chupaam i raxchee' re' taqe i aj Judá xkehchaaj taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Samir, Jatir, Soco. <verse number="49" style="v" />Dana, Quiriat-sana, Debir wo' chik i rub'ihnaal inkiq'or. <verse number="50" style="v" />Re' Anab, re' Estemoa, re' Anim. <verse number="51" style="v" />Gosén, Holón, Gilo, junlaj chi tinamit chu'nchel, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Re' taqe haa' i tinamit Arab, Duma, Esán, <verse number="53" style="v" />Janum, Bet-tapúa, Afeca, <verse number="54" style="v" />Humta, Quiriat-arba, Hebrón wo' chik i b'ih inkiq'or, Sior, b'elejeeb' chi tinamit, haa' taqe kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Eh haa' wo' taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Maón, Carmel, Zif, Juta, <verse number="56" style="v" />Jerzeel, Jocdeam, Zanoa, <verse number="57" style="v" />Caín, Gabaa, Timna, lajeeb' taqe chi tinamit, haa' taqe kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Eh haa' taqe i tinamit je' wili i kib'ihnaal: Halhul, Bet-sur, Gedor, <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarat, Bet-anot, Eltecón, waqiib' taqe chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Re' wo' haa' taqe tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Quiriat-baal, Quiriat-jearim wo' inkiq'or reh, Rabá, re' haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xkehchaaj taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Bet-arabá, Midín, Secaca, <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibsán, re' tinamit i nelik wii' i aatz'aam, En-gadi, waqiib' taqe chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel. Re' i xkehchaaj i riih rumaam i Judá.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Eh re' keh ma' xkian ta reje kehteesjiik taqe i aj jebuseo wilkeeb' ar Jerusaleem. Je' re' noq re' taqe i aj jebuseo ar Jerusaleem xi kahnik chi jumpech chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Judá.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i ye'aab' wili xkehchaaj i riih rumaam Efraín</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq sik'ooj chik chi riij re' wili i ye'aab' kehchaaj i riih rumaam José: Ar xtohq'ik parelb'aal q'iij reh i nim ha' Jordán. Eh xponik chi chii' k'achlik ha' Jericó, xooj chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq', xooj johtoq pantaq rax chee' wilik chuk'ulwaach i Jericó, xponik Bet-el. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xelik reje Bet-el, Luz wo' inkiq'or reh i xooj i k'oq ko chupaam i tinamit Atarot chupaam i kiye'aab' i aj arquita ko Astarot. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh xooj i k'oq parookb'aal reje q'iij chupaam i kiye'aab' i aj Jafletira. Eh xponik kopan k'ula't reh i tinamit Bet-horón, xponik wo' ko chupaam ar Gezer, xooj k'oloq chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' wili xkehchaaj i riih rumaam i Manasés, riih rumaam i Efraín, re' i kiib' chi rak'uun José.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' wili noq wilik i ruk'ula'tiil i kiye'aab' xkik'ul i riih rumaam Efraín, re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib', parookb'aal reje reh i q'iij, ar xtohq'ik chaloq i Atarot-adar, xponik ko Bet-horón re' tinamit wilik nah yuuq'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' kik'ula't pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, ar xtohq'ik chaloq chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. Eh xponik ar Micmetat, eh ar xponik parelb'aal q'iij reje, xponik ar Jaanat. Eh i xik'ik reje ar Janoa. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh xooj k'oloq ar Atarot, eh Naarat. Eh xponik ar Jericó. Eh xponik i wilik wii' i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ar xtohq'ik chaloq Tapúa xponik i wilik wii' i nim ha' Caná, xponik chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. Re' i wili xch'aqarik keh chu'nchel i riih rumaam Efraín. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh wilik wo' hoq kiib' ixib' i tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel xkehchaaj i riih rumaam Efraín, re' ruuk' i xkehchaaj i riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam i Efraín, ma' xkesaj ta taqe i cananeo wilkeeb' ar Gezer, xkikanaa' chi k'acharik chi kixilak xa re' la' xkiq'or reh i aj cananeo chi naa kianam i tooj, eh ar xi kahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Wili i ye'aab' xkehchaaj i riih rumaam Manasés</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq xsik'ooj chik chi riij, re' ye'aab' wili xkehchaaj i junch'uq chi i riih rumaam Manasés, re' peet rak'uun i José. Eh Maquir i peet rak'uun i Manasés rajaaw i Galaad. Re' taqe riih rumaam i Maquir kow kiib' chi q'aq'inik ruum aj re' xkichop naah i ye'aab' Galaad, i ye'aab' Basán. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i ye'aab' wili xkik'ul chu'nchel riih rumaam i Manasés junch'uq. Re' taqe wili i xik'ulwik reh i ye'aab' wilik chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán: Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Abiezer, taqe riih rumaam i Helec, taqe i riih rumaam i Asriel, taqe riih rumaam i Siquem, taqe i riih rumaam i Hefer, taqe riih rumaam i Semida. Eh xikin riih taqe i José.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' Manasés rajaaw i Maquir, eh re' Maquir rajaaw i Galaad, eh re' Galaad rajaaw i Hefer. Eh re' i Hefer rajaaw i Zelofehad. Eh re' Zelofehad ma' xwihik ta jino'q rak'uun, xarixq'uun i xwihik ho'oob' chi kiib' je' wili i kib'ihnaal: Maala, Noa, Hogla, Milcá, Tirsa. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe ixoq re' re' xiooj ruuk' i Eliazar k'amal b'eeh aj tiij, ruuk' i Josué rak'uun i Nun, kuuk' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel, je' wili i xkiq'or: Re' QaJaaw Dios ruq'orom reh i Moisés chi naa wo' taq aye'em qaye'aab' i hoj je' rukab' i xkik'ul i ma' tokoom ta quuk', inki taqe. Eh re' Josué xuyeew wo' kiye'aab' je' rukab' i xkik'ul i ma' tokoom ta kuuk', je' rukab' i ruq'orom i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq re' taqe i riih rumaam Manasés lajeeb' seht chik i naah i kiye'aab' xkik'ul chuwach i xkik'ul Galaad, ruch'ihil i Basán, re' wilik chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruum re' taqe i rixq'uun i Zelofehad riih rumaam i Manasés ye'arik wo' kiye'aab' chi kixilak taqe i riih rumaam winaq. Eh re' ye'aab' Galaad xye'arik keh i junch'uq chik chi riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' kiye'aab' xkik'ul i riih rumaam i Manasés ar xtohq'ik chaloq chupaam i ye'aab' Aser, eh xponik ko chupaam i ye'aab' Micmetat. Re' i ye'aab' wilik chuk'ul wach i ye'aab' Siquem, eh xooj k'oloq chupaam i ye'aab' Tapúa. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i ye'aab' ar Tapúa xkahnik chi keh i riih rumaam i Manasés, xa re' la' re' ye'aab' Tapúa wilik pank'ula't i ye'aab' re' re' xkahnik keh i riih rumaam i Efraín. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh wilik wo' i ye'aab' xkahnik keh i riih rumaam i Efraín re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Manasés. Re' kiye'aab' i keh, ar xtohq'ik chi chii' i nim ha' Caná. Ar xelik chaloq pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij xponik pank'ula't pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, xponik inokik wii' i nim ha' chupaam i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Efraín, ar wilik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eh re' kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Manasés ar wilik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eh re' i palaw inq'atwik paam. Eh pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij i ruk'ula'teej i kiye'aab' i Aser, eh parelb'aal reje q'iij i ruk'ula'teej i kiye'aab' i Isacar. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh wilik wo' hoq i tinamit xkik'ul i riih rumaam i Manasés, wilik pankiyuq'ul i Isacar, i Aser je' wili i kib'ihnaal: Bet-seán, Ibleam, Dor, Endor, ruch'ihil taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel kichopom naah. Eh je' wo' hoq i tinamit Maguidor, ruch'ihil ixib' chi tinamit wilkeeb' chinaah i rub'ohl i yuuq'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam i Manasés ma' xkian ta reje rehtesjiik chupaam i tinamit re' re' taqe i aj cananeo, ruum re' taqe i aj cananeo ma' xkaaj ta elik ar, je' re' noq xi kahnik chi wihik chi kixilak. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh noq xikowjik i aj Israel i xkiq'or reh taqe i aj cananeo chi naa kianam i tooj, eh xama' xkesaj ta wo' taqe reje ar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam José je' wili i xkiq'or reh i Josué:</para>
  <para style="p">¿Chib'ih reet noq xa re' i qaye'aab' wili xayeew? Re' hoj k'ahchi' wo' cho kooj rukuxisam QaJaaw Dios ruum i re' hoj k'ih chiqiib', inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Ruum chi k'ih taq chawiib' i hat ma' ti ruk'am ta taq chik i naah taqe yuuq' wilkeeb' wii' taqe i riih rumaam i Efraín. Eh neerub'an chi nee taq tiooj chupaam taqe i ye'aab' nimaq ch'ahn wach kore' taq i hat neenaqasaj wach, chupaam i kiye'aab' i aj eferezeo, i kiye'aab' i aj refaita, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam José je' wili i xkiq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Korik noq ma' nee ta manlojik qeh i yuuq' re' re'. Eh re' taqe i aj cananeo wilkeeb' ar je' wo' taqe i wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' wach k'ixkaab' wilik kich'ihch' kareta. Eh je' wo' taqe i wilkeeb' Bet-seán, eh i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel, je' wo' taqe i wilkeeb' wach k'ixkaab' Jezreel, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i riih rumaam i Efraín, i riih rumaam i Manasés:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' chi re' taq i hat xiik' taq naah ak'ihaal, ruum i re' q'e' taq kow awiib': Ruum aj re' i ruk'ul chi naa taq awehchaam i ye'aab' xnuq'or taq aweh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taqe i yuuq' re' re' chee' wach naa taq awehchaam, eh kore' taq i hat naa aqasanik wach. Eh re' taqe i aj cananeo wilkeeb' ar korehtaal taq inawesaj reje, atoob' ta re' keh q'e' kow kiib', atoob' ta k'ih i kikareta wilik, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i ye'aab' xkik'ul i wuquub' ch'uq chi aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chu'nchel i aj Israel xkimol kiib' ar Silo, ar xkiyejaa' i santo laj itz'ihy naah paat molb'al iib'. Eh chupaam taqe q'iij re' re' kichopom chik naah taqe i ye'aab' re' re'. <verse number="2" style="v" />Xa re' la' ko wuquub' naq chik ch'uq taqe i aj Israel komajaa' inkik'ul i kiye'aab'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i aj Israel: ¿Chib'ih taq chik i naawuy-eej chi ma' naachop ta taq naah i ye'aab' ruye'em taq aweh i kaJaaw ki Dios qamaam qati't? <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taq i hat cha sik' taq wach ox ox-oq i winaq chi kixilak i ju'jun ch'uq chi awuch aj Israel, reh chi re' hin neenutaq'aaj taqe chi rutahariik i ye'aab'. Eh neen k'ulik kiq'or weh nik' wach noq wilik chi je' re' nee nuch'aq taq aweh i hat. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe winaq re' re' wuquub' nee nkesaj i ye'aab', re' wilik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij naa rukahniik keh i riih rumaam i Judá. Eh re' wilik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij naa rukahniik keh i riih rumaam i José. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq kich'aqam chik wuquub' chik kesam neenkitz'ihb'aaj cho rehtalil nekik'am cho weh, eh ayu' neenqasik' chi riij chuwach i QaJaaw i qaDios. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam Leví ma' naa ta ruye'ariik kiye'aab', re' i naa ruye'ariik kekeh re' chi naa kikahniik chi k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij taqe chuwach i Dios. Eh re' taqe riih rumaam i Gad, taqe i riih rumaam i Rubén, i yejaal i ch'uq reh i riih rumaam i Manasés, xye'arik kiye'aab' i keh chi juntar i nim ha' Jordán parelb'aal reje i q'iij. Re' i xye'arik keh ruum i Moisés raj kamanoom i Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i naa rojiik kitz'ihb'aam nik' wach noq wilik i ye'aab', xkichop kik'ux chi ojik, je' wili xq'orarik reje keh ruum i Josué: Hiy taq chawil chu'nchel i ye'aab' chach'aq taq, noq akohlaam taq chik, cha tz'ihb'aaj taq rehtalil chak'am taq cho weh, reh chi re' hin neenusik' chi riij ayu' Silo chuwach i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe winaq re' re' xooj wo' kib'ehuj paam chu'nchel i ye'aab' xkich'aq wuquub' xkesaj, eh kitz'ihb'aaj cho rehtalil chu'nchel, xkik'am cho reh i Josué ar Silo, re' wilik wii' i ki-itz'ihy naah paat. <verse number="10" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' Josué xusik' chi riij chuwach i Dios noq xuch'aq i ye'aab' Silo noq xuyeew keh i aj Israel, re' q'oreel aha' wilik i xkahnik keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh noq sik'ooj chik chi riij aha' wilik i ye'aab' naa rukahniik keh, re' taqe riih rumaam Benjamín, ar xkik'ul i kiye'aab' chupaam i ruyuq'ul i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Judá i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i José. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' ye'aab' xkik'ul imponik k'ula'tinoq pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, xponik ko chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. Eh xooj i k'oq pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i Jericó, eh xik'ik ponoq pantaq rax chee' wilik parookb'aal i q'iij. Eh ar xooj k'oloq panchiq yuuq' Bet-avén. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh xooj k'oloq chupaam i ye'aab' Luz rub'ihnaal, re' wo' hoq i Bet-el. Eh re' i k'ula't pansak'aaj reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij xooj k'oloq ar Atarot-adar, xooj k'oloq chinaah yuuq' wilik pansak'aaj reje reh i rookb'aal i q'iij reh i tinamit Bet-horón wilik panyuuq'. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' i ruk'ula'tiil i kiye'aab' ar Bet-horón wilik chuk'ulwaach, xponik ko chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, xponik kochuwach i Quiriat-baal, eh Quiriat-jearim, wo' inkiq'or reh. Re' ye'aab' re' re' keh taqe i riih rumaam i Judá, re' taqe i re' i ruk'ula'tiil chi korkiil reje i rookb'aal i q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' ruk'ula'tiil pansak'aaj reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij ar intohq'ik chaloq Quiriat-jearim, xponik i wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' Neftoa wilik chi korkiil reje i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh xooj qohoq chu'nchel i yuuq' wilik chuk'ulwaach i k'ixkaab' Ben-hinom, pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i k'ixkaab' Refaim. Eh xqajik qohoq wach k'ixkaab' Hinom, xik'ik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij wilkeeb' wii' i aj jebuseo, eh xooj eloq i wilik wii' i k'achlik ha' Rogel. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xsutinik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij chupaam i ye'aab' En-semes, eh xooj k'oloq Gelilot, re' wilik chuk'ulwaach i yuuq' Adumín. Eh xponik i wilik wii' i paat ab'aj, wilik paruye'aab' i Bohán i rak'uun i Rubén. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh xik'ik reje chuwach i yuuq' wilik chuk'ulwaach i ye'aab' Arabá, i wilik pansak'aaj reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij imponik ko Arabá. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' k'ula't re' re' xik'ik ponoq Bet-hogla wilik pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij, xooj kuxoq chi chii' i kamnaq palaw, re' i xooj okoq wii' i rooq i nim ha' Jordán. Re' wili i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' pansak'aaj reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' parelb'aal reje i q'iij re' i nim ha' Jordán. Re' i ye'aab' re' re' xch'aqarik keh i riih rumaam Benjamín re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib' chi kich'uhqaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit xye'arik keh i riih rumaam i Benjamín je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jericó, Bet-hogla, wach k'ixkaab' Casis, <verse number="22" style="v" />Bet-arabá, Zemaraim, Bet-el, <verse number="23" style="v" />Avim, Pará, Ofra, <verse number="24" style="v" />Quefar-haamoni, Ofni, Geba. Eh kab'laj chi kiib' chu'nchel i tinamit, ruch'ihil taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel kichopom naah. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh xye'arik keh i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Gabaón, Ramá, Beerot, <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpa, Cafira, Mozah, <verse number="27" style="v" />Requem, Irpeel, Tarala, <verse number="28" style="v" />Zela, Elef, Jebús, eh Jerusaleem wo' kiq'or reh, Gabaa, Quiriat. Eh kajlaj chi kiib' i tinamit, ruch'ihil taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel kichopom naah re' xye'arik keh i riih rumaam Benjamín, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ye'aab' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Simeón</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i rukab' ye'aab' xkisik' chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik, re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Simeón. Re' ye'aab' re' re' ar xkahnik chupaam i ruyuq'ul i kiye'aab' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Judá. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xye'arik keh i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Beerseba, Seba, Molada, <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-sual, Bala, Ezem, <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Betul, Horma, <verse number="5" style="v" />Siglag, Bet-marcabot, Hazar-susa, <verse number="6" style="v" />Bet-lebaot, Saruhén, oxlaj taqe chi tinamit haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii patineel. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh xye'arik wo' keh taqe i ye'aab': Aín, Rimón, Eter, Asán kajseht taqe chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh haa' wo' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel, xponik ko Baalat-beer, re' wo' hoq i Ramat, wilik paruyuq'ul Neguev. Re' taqe i ye'aab' re' re' xye'arik keh taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Simeón, re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kiye'aab' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Simeón re' wo' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Judá. Ruum re' keh xiik' naah nimaal i ye'aab' xye'arik keh ruum aj re' wilik xye'arik keh taqe i riih rumaam i Simeón.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' roox ye'aab' xkisik' chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik, re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Zabulón, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. Re' ye'aab' xkik'ul korehtaal xponik chupaam i tinamit Sarid. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i ruk'ula'tiil wilik reje parookb'aal q'iij i xooj k'oloq ko chupaam i ye'aab' Marala. Eh chi riij i re' xooj k'oloq Dabeset, ar xooj kuxoq chi chii' i nim ha' wilik chuk'ulwaach i tinamit Jocneam. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh ar xponik sutinoq Sarid i wilik chi korkiil i xelik cho wii' i q'iij, xponik kopan k'ula't, ruuk' i ye'aab' Quislot-tabor, eh ar xooj k'oloq i wilik wii' i ye'aab' Daberat, inooj k'oloq chinaah i yuuq' Jafía. <verse number="13" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xik'ik ponoq chi korkiil reje ireelb'aalq'iij chupaam i ye'aab' Gat-hefer, eh ar Ita-cazín, xooj k'oloq ko Rimón, i rukotej riij i ye'aab' Nea. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij xik'ik reje Hanatón, eh xooj eloq wach k'ixkaab' Jefte-el. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh xik'ik ponoq chupaam i tinamit Catat, je' wo' Naalal, je' wo' Simrón, je' wo' Idala, eh Belén. Kab'laj taqe chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' wili xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Zabulón, re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib', ha' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' ar, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' rukaaj i ye'aab' xkisik' chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik, re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Isacar, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' ye'aab' xkik'ul re' je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jezreel, Quesulot, Sunem, <verse number="19" style="v" />Hafaraim, Sihón, Anaharat, <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabit, Quisión, Ebez, <verse number="21" style="v" />Remet, En-ganim, En-hada, Bet-pases. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' re' re' xponik chupaam i ye'aab' Tabor, Sahazima, Bet-semes, eh ar inooj kuxoq chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. Waqlaj chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' i patineel. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe ye'aab' wili xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Isacar haa' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' ar, haa' taqe kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' roo' ye'aab' xkisik' chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Aser, re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit xkik'ul je' wili kib'ihnaal: Helcat, Halí, Betén, Acsaf, <verse number="26" style="v" />Alamelec, Amad, Misal. Ar xponik kochinaah i yuuq' Carmelo, chi korkiil reje i rookb'aal i q'iij, xponik wo' hoq ko Sihor-libnat. <verse number="27" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xponik chi korkiil reje i reelb'aal q'iij ar Bet-dagón. Xponik ko ar Zabulón, xponik wach k'ixkaab' reh i Jefte-el pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, xponik Bet-emec ar Neiel, eh xik'ik ponoq Cabul. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh xponik wo' chupaam taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Hebrón, Rehob, Hamón, Caná. Eh xponik i wilik wii' i nimlaj tinamit Sidón. <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh re' ruk'ula'tiil i kiye'aab' xsutinik chaloq ar Ramá, eh xponik chupaam i ar Tiro i kotimaj riij chi tz'aq, i xooj eloq Hosa, ar xooj eloq chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, i xooj k'oloq Mahaleb, eh ar Aczib. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh je' wo' ar Uma, Afec, eh ar Rehob. Kiib' ru ka'winaq chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' wili i ye'aab' xkichop naah i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Aser, haa' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chupaam, haa' taqe kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel, re' q'oreel nik' kik'ihaal chi kiib' chi riih rumaam i Neftalí.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' ruwaaq ye'aab' xsik'arik chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik, re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Neftalí re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' ruk'ula'tiil i ye'aab' xkik'ul xponik chupaam i tinamit Helef, Alón-saananim, Adami-neceb, eh xponik ar Janeel, je' wo' chupaam i ye'aab' Lacum, ar inooj k'oloq chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh re' ruk'ula'tiil parookb'aal i q'iij, xooj k'oloq ar Aznot-tabor, xooj k'oloq ar Hucoc. Eh xooj pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam Zabulón. Eh xooj wo' panookb'al reh i q'iij pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Aser. Eh inooj parelb'aal q'iij, pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Judá, chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit kotimaj riij chi tz'aq xye'arik keh i riih rumaam i Neftalí je' wili kib'ihnaal: Sidim, Zer, Hamat, Racat, Cineret, <verse number="36" style="v" />Adama, Romá, Hazor, <verse number="37" style="v" />Cedes, Edrei, En-hazor, <verse number="38" style="v" />Irón, Migdal-el, Horem, Bet-anat, Bet-semes. B'elejlaj chi tinamit, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel. <verse number="39" style="v" />Re' taqe re' i ye'aab' xkik'ul i riih rumaam i Neftalí, haa' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chupaam, haa' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Re' ruwuuq ye'aab' xkisik' chi riij awach eh naa rukahniik, re' xkik'ul i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Dan. Re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'. <verse number="41" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit xkik'ul je' wili kib'ihnaal: Zora, Estaol, Ir-semes. <verse number="42" style="v" />Saalabín, Ajalón, Jetla, <verse number="43" style="v" />Elón, Timnat, Ecrón, <verse number="44" style="v" />Elteque, Gibetón, Baalat, <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehúd, Bene-berac, Gat-rimón, <verse number="46" style="v" />Mejarcón, Racón, ruch'ihil i tinamit wilik reje chi k'ulwaach i tinamit Jope. <verse number="47" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Dan Ma' xmanlojik ta keh i ye'aab' re' re', je' re' noq xiooj chi peleto chupaam i tinamit Lesem, eh noq kikansaj chik chu'nchel i patim taqe ar xkichop naah xi okik chi patinik chupaam i tinamit re' re'. Eh xkijal wach i rub'ihnaal Dan chik i rub'ihnaal xkikoj ruum je' re' i rub'ihnaal chaloq i xikin kimaam. <verse number="48" style="v" />Re' wili i ye'aab' ruch'ihil taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chupaam, ruch'ihil wo' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel i jun ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Dan. Re' q'oreel nik' k'ihaal chi kiib'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i aj Israel kikohlaam chik ruch'aqariik chu'nchel i ye'aab'. Eh kik'ulum chik i kiye'aab' chi kich'uhqaal. Re' Josué rak'uun i Nun xye'arik wo' ruye'aab' chi kixilak i aj Israel. <verse number="50" style="v" />Eh xkian wo' hoq i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios xkiyeew wo' reh i Josué i ye'aab' Timnat-sera wilik paraxchee', re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Efraín, re' wo' hoq i rupahqaam i Josué. Eh re' reh xuyejaa' wo' chik i tinamit re' re', eh xokik chi patinik ar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' wili xuch'aq i Eliazar i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel ruch'ihil i Josué rak'uun i Nun, kuch'ihil taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel, noq wilkeeb' ar Silo. Re' i xkisik' chi riij i ye'aab' chuwach i QaJaaw Dios panookb'al reh i santo laj itz'ihy naah paat molb'al iib', aha' wilik i naa rukahniik keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. Eh je' re' noq xkikohlaaj ruch'aqariik chu'nchel i ye'aab'.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' rusik'ariik kiwach i tinamit ke'emb'al iib'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Josué: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi kisik' wach taqe i tinamit ke'emb'al iib', je' rukab' i nuq'orom cho reh i Moisés. <verse number="3" style="v" />Reh chi chupaam i tinamit re' re' nenooj rukeb'aa' riib' i xa chi ma' reht'al nee rukansaj i ras ruchaaq' ma' xata raaj noq neerub'an reh. Eh ar neeruko'leej riib' reh chi ma' nee ta inkanteesjik i reh ruum i awach reh i kamnaq, k'ahchi' rusik'wiik reh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh awach i naa rojiik rukeb'aam riib' chupaam jino'q keh i tinamit re' re', noq naa ruponiik panookb'al koruman chi naa ruch'ob'om rub'ehel chikiwach taqe kitaaq'anik chupaam i tinamit re' re'. Eh re' keh naakiye'em q'ab' reh chi naa rokiik i koq ar, eh naakiye'em ruye'aab', reh chi ar naa rupatiniik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i awach reh i kamnaq xooj k'oloq chi rusik'ariik i xb'anik kaansanik, re' taqe i kitaaq'anik ar ma' nee ta kiq'asaj pan q'ab' i xb'anik ikaansanik ruum ma' xata raaj chi xukansaj i ras ruchaaq' ma' ruum ta chi wilik rupeleto ruuk'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' reh ar naa rukeb'aam riib' chupaam i tinamit re' re' korehtaal inq'atarik i q'orik chinaah chikiwach i tinamit. Eh korehtaal inkimik reje i wilik chi kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh i aj tiij, chupaam i q'iij re' re'. Eh chi riij i re' kora'j nee wo' chik i rub'an re' chi nee wo' chik inooj chupaam re' i rutinamiit xelik cho wii', nee wo' chik inooj parupaat, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i tinamit wili xkisik' wach i aj Israel: Re' Cedes wilik Galilea, wilik wii' rax chee' nah i yuuq' pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Neftalí, re' i Siquem wilik nah yuuq' pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Efraín. Eh re' i Quiriat-arba, Ehbrón wo' hoq inkiq'or reh, wilik chinaah i yuuq' pan kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Judá. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chi juntar reje i nim ha' Jordán parookb'aal q'iij reh i Jericó xkisik' wach taqe i tinamit wili: Re' Basán i wilik wach k'ixkaab' chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' i wilkeeb' wii' i riih rumaam i Rubén, je' wo' hoq i tinamit Ramot, ar Galaad, wilkeeb' wii' riih rumaam i Gad. Re' i tinamit Golán wilkeeb' wii' taqe i riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i tinamit wili xkisik' wach i aj Israel chi ke'emb'al kiib' i keh, je' wo' taqe i tokoom tinamit patim chi kixilak. Eh reh chi ar nenooj rukeb'aa' riib' awach i nee rukansaj jino'q i ras ruch'aaq' chi ma' reht'al reh chi ma' nee tankanteesjik ruum i awach reh i kamnaq, noq komajaa' inq'atarik i q'orik chinaah chikiwach i tinamit.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe tinamit xkik'ul taqe i riih rumaam Leví</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 6:54-81">1 Cron 6.54-81</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh chi kixilak i riih rumaam Leví xiooj ruuk' i Eleazar k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, ruuk' i Josué rak'uun i Nun, kuuk' i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel. <verse number="2" style="v" />Xkian kik'utaaj kuuk' ar Silo wilik ar Canaán, je' wili i xkiq'or ponoq keh: Re' QaJaaw Dios ruq'orom cho reh i Moisés chi naa ruye'ariik qatinamiit naa qawihiik wii', je' wo' hoq i kiye'aab' i qachikoop, inki taqe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xkiyeew wo' i re' ruuk' i kitinamiit, chi kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam Leví, eh xye'arik wo' kiye'aab' i kichikoop, je' rukab' i ruq'orom QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh noq xkisik' chi riij aha' wilik naa ruye'ariik keh taqe i riih rumaam Leví, re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam Coat rak'uun Aarón, k'amal cho kib'eeh aj tiij. Eh oxlaj chi tinamit i xye'arik keh re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Judá, taqe riih rumaam i Simeón, taqe riih rumaam i Benjamín. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i junch'uq chik chi riih rumaam Coat xkik'ul lajeeb' seht chi tinamit re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Efraín, taqe riih rumaam i Dan, re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' taqe yejaal keh i riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh xkik'ul wo' kitinamiit taqe i riih rumaam Gersón, re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' riih rumaam i Isacar, taqe i riih rumaam i Aser, taqe riih rumaam i Neftalí, re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i yejaal ch'uq keh i riih rumaam i Manasés. Oxlaj seht chi tinamit i xkik'ul ar Basán. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Levíta re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam Merari kab'laj chi tinamit i xye'arik keh re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam i Rubén, taqe i riih rumaam i Gad, taqe riih rumaam i Zabulón.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkisik' chi riij noq xkiyeew taqe i tinamit re' re' keh i aj Levíta, eh kiyeew wo' ye'aab' kichikoop je' rukab' i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' wili i kib'ihnaal i tinamit xye'arik keh taqe i riih rumaam Leví kuum taqe i riih rumaam Judá, i riih rumaam Simeón. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq xkisik' chi riij awach naakiye'em reh chi peet, peet xkiyeew reh taqe i aj Levíta re' ruuk' i riih rumaam Coat, rak'uun i Aarón. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh ar xye'arik keh pantaq raxchee' re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam Judá, xye'arik keh i Quiriat-arba, re' i Hebrón re' rutinamiit i nim rooq winaq Anac rub'ihnaal, xye'arik wo' ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' wilkeeb' chi junsuut i tinamit, taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' wii' patineel, xye'arik chi ruye'aab' i Caleb rak'uun i Jefone.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i xkiyeew reh taqe i riih ruum Aarón re' i tinamit Hebrón. Re' wo' re' xkisik' wach reh chi ar naa rojiik rukeb'aam riib' awach i naa rukansam i ras ruchaaq' chi ma' reht'al, re' taqe haa' i tinamit je' wili i kib'ihnaal: <verse number="14" style="v" />Libna, Jatir, Estemoa, <verse number="15" style="v" />Holón, Debir, <verse number="16" style="v" />Aín, Juta, Bet-semes. Re' taqe i b'elejeeb' chi tinamit re' re' ye'arik keh chi kiye'aab' ruch'ihil taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. Re' xye'arik keh kuum taqe i riih rumaam i Judá, i riih rumaam i Simeón. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' i tinamit xye'arik keh kuum taqe i riih rumaam i Benjamín, re' taqe i wili: Gabaón, Geba, <verse number="18" style="v" />Anatot, Almón, kajseht chi tinamit, haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="19" style="v" />Je' re' noq oxlaj chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop, xye'arik keh i riih rumaam Aarón kajaaw k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i junch'uq chik chi riih rumaam Coat rak'uun Leví xkik'ul i kitinamiit kuuk' i riih rumaam Efraín. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh xye'arik wo' keh i tinamit Siquem, wilik paraxchee' re' wilkeeb' wii' i riih rumaam i Efraín, re' wo' re' xkisik' wach chi ar naa rojiik rukeb'aam riib' awach i xa chi ma' reht'al i nee rukansaj i ras ruchaaq'. Eh xye'arik wo' keh i tinamit Gezer. <verse number="22" style="v" />Je' wo' hoq i tinamit Kibsaim, Bet-horón kajseht chi tinamit i xye'arik keh haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' i tinamit xye'arik keh i aj Levíta re' re' kuum i riih rumaam i Dan, re' je' wili kib'ihnaal: Elteque, Gibetón, <verse number="24" style="v" />Ajalón, Gat-timón, kajseht chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh kuuk' i yejaal ch'uq' chi riih rumaam i Manasés ka'seht i tinamit xkik'ul. Re' i Taanac, re' i Gat-rimón, haa' i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="26" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taqe i aj Levíta riih rumaam i Coat lajeeb' seht chi tinamit i xkik'ul, haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam Gersón, rak'uun i Leví ka'seht i tinamit xkiyeew reh i yejaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés. Re' i tinamit Beestera, ruch'ihil i Golán, i wilkeeb' ar Basán, haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. Re' wo' re' xkisik' wach chi ar neenooj rukeb'aa' riib' awach i nee rukansaj i ras ruchaaq' chi ma' reht'al. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh xye'arik keh ruum i riih rumaam i Isacar taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Cisón, Deberat, <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmut, En-ganim, kijib' chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh kuuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Aser, xkik'ul taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Misael, Abdón, <verse number="31" style="v" />Helcat, Rehob. Kijib' chi tinamit, haa' i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Neftalí xkik'ul taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Hamot-dor, Cartán, Cedas i wilik ar Galilea. Re' taqe i tinamit re' re' xkisik' wach, reh chi ar nenooj rukeb'aa' riib' awach i nee rukansaj i ras ruchaaq' chi ma' reht'al. <verse number="33" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taqe i riih rumaam i Gersón, ox laj seht chi tinamit i ye'arik keh haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i riih rumaam i Merari, rak'uun Leví i majaa' naq inkik'ul kiye'aab', xkik'ul kiye'aab' i kuuk' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Zabulón, re' taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jocneam, Carta, <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimna, Naalal, kajseht chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eh kuuk' junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén xkik'ul wo' taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Beser, Jahaza, <verse number="37" style="v" />Cademot, Mefáat, kajseht chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="38" style="v" />Eh kuuk' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Gad, xkik'ul taqe i tinamit je' wili kib'ihnaal: Mahanaim, Ramot wilik ar Galaad. Re' wo' taqe re' xkisik' wach reh chi ar neenooj rukeb'aa' riib' awach i nee rukansaj i ras ruchaaq' chi ma' reht'al, <verse number="39" style="v" />Re' i Hesbón, Jazer, kajseht chi tinamit haa' taqe i ye'aab' kichikoop. <verse number="40" style="v" />Re' taqe i wili chu'nchel i tinamit xkik'ul i riih rumaam Merari rak'uun i Leví, re' noq komajaa' naq inkik'ul kiye'aab', kab'laj seht chi tinamit chu'nchel i xkik'ul.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Re' kitinamiit xkik'ul i aj Levíta, xkik'ul chupaam i kiye'aab' i kuch aj Israel waxiqiib' roxk'ahl seht chi tinamit haa' i ye'aab' kichikoop chi junsuut i ju'jun seht chi kitinamiit. <verse number="42" style="v" />Re' taqe i ju'jun seht chi tinamit wili chi kiju'junaal wilkeeb', eh wilik i ye'aab' kichikoop chi kijunsuut. Je' re' noq xye'arik kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam i Leví.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' QaJaaw Dios i rub'an aha' wilik i ruq'or</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' QaJaaw Dios xuyeew keh i aj Israel i ye'aab' ruq'orom chee xti korik keh i kimaam kati't chi naa ruye'em keh. Re' taqe i aj Israel xkichop wo' naah, eh xi okik chi k'acharik ar. <verse number="44" style="v" />Eh re' QaJaaw Dios xub'an wo' hoq aha' wilik i ruq'orom cho rib'iral, xuyeew wo' keh i suq laj wihik chupaam chu'nchel i kitinamiit. Ma' xta xi uchjik kuum i nixowanik kiwach ruum re' i QaJaaw Dios xtoob'inik keh chi xkiq'at wach taqe i re'. <verse number="45" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i q'e' holohik xuq'or cho rib'iral i QaJaaw Dios keh i aj Israel xub'an wo' hoq, ma' jino'q chik i xukanaa' chi ma' ta xub'an.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' artaal xkiyejaa' chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xuyuq'eej i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam Manasés, <verse number="2" style="v" />je' wili i xuq'or keh: Re' taq i hat xa a'n taq chu'nchel i xuq'or taq cha weh i Moisés raj kamanoom chee QaJaaw Dios. Eh xa a'n taq i xnuq'or taq aweh i hin. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ma' jank'al ta taq inakanaa' chi kutkeel taq awuch aj Israel, eh xa ko je' wo' re' i k'ahchi' taq kaat yu'naak. Eh xa a'n wo' taq chi korik i ruq'or i ruk'uhb'aal QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh yu'naak xub'an chik i QaJaaw Dios i xuq'or cho rib'iral keh taq awuch aj Israel, k'acharik chik inki a'n pansuqkiil k'uxliis chupaam i kiye'aab'. Re' taq i hat ti sutinoq wo' taq chik reje juntar i nim ha' Jordán pana itz'ihy naah paat chupaam i ye'aab' xuyeew taq aweh i Moisés raj kamanoom i QaJaaw Dios <verse number="5" style="v" />Xa re' i nupahqaaj taq aweh chi cha a'n taq chu'nchel i ruq'or i ruk'uhb'aal, ruch'ihil taq i tirutaq'aaj wii' re' i xuq'or taq cha weh i Moisés raj kamanoom i Dios. Iraaj ruq'orom chi naa taq ak'axam aaWaJaaw aaDios, chak'am taq i rub'eeh chi korik, je' wo' hoq i tirutijej taq wii', maakanaa' taq chik. Cha a'n taq i rukamaj chu'nchel ak'ux, chu'nchel taq awánima, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xikuxeesjik ruum i Josué, eh xi sutinik wo' chik reje chupaam i ki-itz'ihy naah paat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' yejaal i ch'uq reh i riih rumaam Manasés xye'arik kiye'aab' paruyuq'ul i Basán ruum i Moisés. Eh re' chik i yejaal ch'uq i riih rumaam Manasés, re' i Josué xye'wik kiye'aab' chi kixilak i kuch aj Israel chi juntar chaloq i nim ha' Jordán parookb'aal reje i q'iij. Eh re' i Josué xukuxisaj taqe noq xutaq'aaj taqe reje pan kiye'aab'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or reje keh: Yu'naak taq i hat ti sutinoq wo' chik taq reje chupaam aye'aab' hiy taq cha a'n rusuqkiil ab'ehomal re' taq aachikoop taq aa oro, taq aa plata, taq aa q'an ch'ihch', taq aa rax ch'ihch', taqe i itz'ihy chawunej taq aawas achaaq' i xaq'uch taq keh i ki-ixowanik taq awach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq xi sutinik wo' chik reje pan kiye'aab' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i jun ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq i riih rumaam i Manasés. Noq kich'aq kiib' kuuk' i kuch aj Israel ar Silo. Wilik paruyuq'ul i Canaán, reh chi xi sutinik wo' chik reje paruyuq'ul i Galaad, re' kik'ulum wii' i kiye'aab', je' wo' rukab' i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios reh i Moisés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq xi ponik pank'ula't i wilik wii' i nim ha' Jordán i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, eh junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq i riih rumaam i Manasés, xkiyejaa' i jinaj i nimlaj artaal ko chupaam i ye'aab' Canaán chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel junch'uq xponik rib'iral kuuk' chi re' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés, chi pank'ula't reh i Canaán chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán xkiyejaa' i artaal. Ko chupaam wo' hoq i kiye'aab' i aj Israel. <verse number="12" style="v" />Noq xkib'iraj chi je' re' i aj Israel xanoq wo' xkimol kiib' ar Silo reh chi xiooj naq chi peleto kuuk'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' keh peet xkitaq'aaj reje chupaam i ye'aab' Galaad, eh Finees rak'uun i Eleazar k'amal kib'eeh i aj tiij, re' i wilkeeb' wii' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh chi riij i winaq re' re' lajeeb' i k'amal b'eeh chi kixilak i juntz'uhb' chi aj Israel xiooj pankib'ihnaal taqe i ju'junch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu'nchel i re' xiooj ar Galaad re' i wilkeeb' wii' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés, je' wili xkiq'or ponoq:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hoj xoj chaal q'oroq pankib'ihnaal qatinamiit Israel ¿Chib'ih reet noq xa a'n taq i mahk wili chuwach i QaJaaw Dios? ¿Chib'ih reet noq xayejaa' taq i artaal wili? ¿Chib'ih reet noq xaq'at taq wach i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios? <verse number="17" style="v" />¿Mi ma' aweht'al taq re' hat chi xiik' naah i mahk i xqa'an noq xqaloq'ej chee tiyoox chupaam i ye'aab' Peor? Eh re' mahk re' re' xa ko wilik wo' chi qanaah yu'naak. Eh ruum i re' ma' k'isiin i rutinamiit i QaJaaw Dios xikimik. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh yu'naak taq i hat ruuk' taq i xa a'n re' re' xaq'eb' wo' taq chi riij ak'ux i QaJaaw Dios, xaq'ehtaaj taq awiib' chuwach i QaJaaw. Eh ruum taq i xa a'n re' re' jumehq'iil naa ruye'em chaloq i rujosq'iil chi qanaah i hoj, hoj aj Israel. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh wila' nakapaaj taq chi ch'uwa' taq wach aye'aab' wilkaat taq wii' neerub'an chi nee taq ti q'ahxik chupaam i ruye'aab' i QaJaaw re' i wilik wii' i rusanto laj itz'ihy naah paat. Neerub'an chi nee taq inachop aye'aab' chi qaxilak i hoj ma' ruk'ul taj chi nee taq i ti mahkunik chuwach i Dios, eh chi qawach i hoj ruuk' i ruyejeb'jiik i tokoom chik artaal chuwach i ru artaal i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' Acán i rak'uun Zera xmahkunik noq xuchop chi reh i q'asamaj naq chik chi naa rusachariik wach. Eh ruum i re' xchalik rujosq'iil i QaJaaw Dios chi qanaah chi qunchelaal i hoj, hoj aj Israel. Eh ma' xata wo' re' Acán xkimik ruum i mahk xub'an, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh re' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, ruch'ihil i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés, je' wili kichaq'weesjiik i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios i wilik rajaawriik chinaah chu'nchel ineht'alinik reh chib'ih reet noq xqayejaa' i artaal wili. Eh re' reh reht'al mi ruum chi xqaq'eb' chi riij qak'ux, oon ma' chih taj re' reh neenye'wik taq aweh chi naab'jik. Eh wila' ruum chi xqaq'eb' chi riij qak'ux i reh neerub'an chi nee qoh rukansaj. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios neen ye'wik qeh chutojariik i qamahk wila' xqayejaa' i artaal wili reh chi xqaq'eb' chi riij qak'ux i reh, oon reh ye'b'al qamayiij reh chi neenqak'am qiib' panotob'il, oon ye'b'al reh i k'atoj mayiij. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' hoj xqayejaa' i artaal wili reh jinaj ehtalil ruum qohyo'jik nee-oq inkiq'or taq awiih aamaam i hat na' chub'an reh taqe i qiih qamaam i hoj chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih reet noq ti chalik taq chi looq'jiik i QaJaaw Dios chupaam i ye'aab' ayu'? <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios re' nim ha' Jordán rukojom chi q'atb'al paam i qaye'aab' taq awuuk' i hat i hat taq riih rumaam i Rubén, i riih rumaam i Gad, i yejaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés, ma' nee ta rub'an chi nee taq inchalik aloq'ej i Dios ayu' inko'q-oq taqe. Chi je' re', re' qiih qamaam, neenkikanaa' ruyohljiik wach i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ruum i re' xqakapaaj chi xqayejaa' i artaal wili, ma' re' ta reh ye'aab' k'atoj mayiij ma' re' ta wo' hoq ye'b'al chik jino'q mayiij. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' artaal wili xqayejaa', rehtalil chi qeh i hoj cha weh taq i hat, eh chi keh naa kiwihiik koq'uun, reh chi neenqaloq'ej i QaJaaw Dios, eh chi neenqayeew i qak'atoj mayiij chuwach, oon re' qamayiij k'amb'al qiib' panotob'il ruuk'. Eh reh chi ma' nee ta nkiq'or na' chub'an awiih aamaam taq i hat keh i qiih qamaam i hoj chi je' wili: Re' taq i hat ma' ruk'ul ta chi nee taq inchalik aloq'ej i QaJaaw Dios ayu', ma' inko'q ta taqe. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh xqakapaaj i hoj chi pan jinaj q'iij wilik nee nq'orik qeh i hoj, oon keh taqe i qiih qamaam i q'orik re' re', re' keh je' wili chaq'wik naa kianam: Chawilow taq re' taqe i qamaam qati't xkiyejaa' i artaal wili chuwach i QaJaaw ma' re' ta ye'b'al k'atoj mayiij ma' re' ta wo' ye'b'al mayiij, xa rehtaliil la' chawach taq i hat rehtalil chi qawach i hoj chi xa jinaj qawach, inko'q taqe. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' hoj ma' nqakapaaj taj rukanab'jiik i qaDios, eh ni xata neenqaq'eb' chi riij qak'ux ruuk' i ruyejeb'jiik jino'q chik i artaal k'atb'al mayiij, ye'b'al chik jino'q i mayiij, oon k'atb'al chikop reh mayiij. Ruum re' hoj qeht'al chi ma' xta chik jino'q artaal chi riij i artaal wilik reje chuwach i rusanto laj itz'ihy naah paat i Dios, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj i Finees chi je' re' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, ruch'ihil taqe i k'amwik kib'eeh chi kitzuhb'aal, ruch'ihil i k'amwik kib'eeh chi kich'uhqaal i aj Israel, xuk'ul kik'ux i xkiq'or i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, i ye'jaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' i Finees rak'uun i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij Eleazar, je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Yu'naak qeht'al chik chi korik chi re' Dios wilik quuk', ruum qanab'eej chik chi ma' re' ta taq rukanab'jiik i Dios taq inawaaj noq xayejaa' taq i artaal wili. Chi je' re' ma' nee ta ruyeew chee ti' k'axik chi qanaah i QaJaaw Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' Finees, ruch'ihil taqe i xiooj chi riij xi elik wo' chik cho ar i wilkeeb' wii' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, i yejaal ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés. Xi elik cho ar Galaad xi chalik wo' chik Canaán, eh xk'ulik kik'utjaaj keh chu'nchel i aj Israel i xq'orarik cho keh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh re' i xkiq'or chaloq i xuk'ul kik'ux chi kunchelaal i aj Israel, eh kiloq'ej i Dios ruum i re'. Eh ma' kota chik xkikapaaj ojik chi q'aq'inik kuuk' chi rusachariik wach i kiye'aab' i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Gad, i yejaal i ch'uq chi riih rumaam i Manasés. <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i junch'uq chi riih rumaam i Rubén, i junch'uq chi riih rumaam Gad, Ed i rub'ihnaal i artaal xkikoj, eh je' wili xkiq'or: Re' artaal wili rehtalil chi qawach chi re' qaDios xa re' wo' reh manlik Dios, inki taqe.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xukoj kina'ojb'al i tinamit Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh k'ih-oq chik haab' ruye'em taqe pansuqkiil k'uxliis i aj Israel i QaJaaw Dios, ma' xta chik q'aq'inik kuuk' taqe i nixowanik kiwach, noq re' Josué k'ih chik i ruhab'ul riji' winaq chik chi korik. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' Josué xutaq'aaj kik'amariik chu'nchel i aj Israel, ruch'ihil i k'amal b'eeh chi kixilak, taqe q'atal q'orik, taqe i kikamanik chi kixilak, je' wili i xuq'or keh: Re' hin k'ih chik i nuhab'ul xin rijb'ik chik chi korik. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taq i hat xawil taq chik i xub'an QaJaaw Dios kuuk' chu'nchel i tinamit ki-ixowanik taq awach, chi k'axb'al taq aweh i hat. Re' QaJaaw Dios xb'anik i peleto taq chawiij. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin xnusik' chi riij noq xnuch'aq chu'nchel i ye'aab' keh i ju'junch'uq chi wuch aj Israel. Eh ma' xata re' i ye'aab' chopooj nah xnuch'aq, nuch'aq la' wo' hoq i komajaa' naq inchoparik naah ar intohq'ik cho chi chii' i nim ha' Jordán imponik ko chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo panookb'al reje reh i q'iij. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios naa resam taqe reje chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' i patineel wilkeeb' ar. Eh re' taq chik i hat naa achopwiik naah, je' wo' rukab' i ruq'orom i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat cha chop taq ak'ux chunimjiik i ruq'or taqe i k'uhb'aal tz'ihb'amaj, re' i xye'arik reh i Moisés. Eh cha a'n taq chu'nchel i ruq'or, ma' t'ooj taq panasak'aaj, ni xata nee taq tiooj panatz'eet. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh maa a'n taq jinaj awach kuuk' i tinamit ko wilkeeb' taq chaxilak ayu'. Eh maa q'or wo' taq i korik pankib'ihnaal i tiyoox inkiloq'ej i keh, ni xata naa taq aloq'em, eh ma' naa ta wo' axuk'aam taq awiib' chikiwach. <verse number="8" style="v" />Maacanaa' taq runimjiik taq aaWaJaaw aaDios je' rukab' i xat k'uloq taq ayu' chub'anariik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xresaj taq reje chawach i ki-ixowanik taq awach i nimaq kiwach kow inki a'n kiib'. Eh xat k'ulik taq iloq ayu' yu'naak chi ma' awach ta taq inkuywik i q'aq'inik taq awuuk'. <verse number="10" style="v" />Xa jinaj chi winaq taq chaxilak i hat neerub'an reje rukaajiik jino'q miil chi aj ixowaal, ruum re' QaJaaw Dios imb'anik i peleto taq chawiij i hat, je' wo' rukab' i ruq'orom chaloq. <verse number="11" style="v" />Je' re' noq chawik'raaj taq awiib' i hat cha ju'junaal cha k'ax taq i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh wila' xakanaa' taq rulooq'jiik i QaJaaw, eh wi xa a'n taq aweh i hat inki a'n i tinamit koxikahnik taq chaxilak. Eh xa a'n taq kaxáro kuuk', i xa a'n taq jinaj awach kuuk'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Chanab'eej taq chi re' i QaJaaw Dios ma' nee ta taq chik ti rutoob'eej, chi kehteesjiik reje i tinamit. Naa la' kikahniik chi xirob' taq cha weh, naa kaat taq kiye'em chi tz'uhuum, eh chi k'iix taq panaq'awach. Korehtaal imponik i q'iij chi ma' jino'q taq chik aweh i hat naa rukahniik chupaam i holohik laj ye'aab' wili i ruye'em taq aweh i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin ponik reh i ruq'ijil i nukimiik, xa re' la' peet inwaaj chi nee taq inakoj rehtaal chi nee taq inanimaj chu'nchel ak'ux, chu'nchel taq awánima chi re' i QaJaaw Dios xub'an chaloq chu'nchel i holohik ruq'orom rib'iral taq aweh. Ma' jino'q chik i xukanaa' chi ma' ta xub'an. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh nik' wach noq xuyeew taq cha weh i holohik ruq'orom cho rib'iral taq aweh i QaJaaw Dios, je' wo' chik re' noq naa ruye'em taq cho cha naah i runimaal i ti' k'axik. Korehtaal imponik i q'iij chi ma' jino'q taq chik aweh i naa rukahniik chupaam i holohik laj ye'aab' wili ruye'em taq aweh i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Wila' ma' xa a'n taq i ruyejaam taq cho wach awuuk' i QaJaaw Dios wila' xat'ooj taq chi kilooqjiik taqe i tiyoox, wi xaxuk'aa' taq awiib' chikiwach. Re' i QaJaaw Dios naa ruchaliik rujosq'iil taq cha naah, jumehq'iil naa rusahchiik taq awach chupaam i ye'aab' wili, q'e' holohik ruye'em taq aweh i reh, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Josué xuk'uhb'alej taqe i aj Israel noq xakimik chik reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' Josué xumol kiwach chu'nchel i aj Israel chuwach i QaJaaw Dios chupaam i ye'aab' Siquem, xumol kiwach taqe i k'amal b'eeh chi kixilak, taqe i q'atal q'orik, taqe ajaab'ees, taqe i kikamanik chi kixilak. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh chu'nchel i tinamit:</para>
  <para style="p">Je' wili i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios i hoj, hoj aj Israel: Najtir cho q'iij re' taq aamaam awati't, re' Taré re' rajaaw Abraham, i Nacor, ar xi k'acharik cho chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. Eh ar xkiloq'ej taqe i tiyoox. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hin xineesanik cho reh taqe i xikin aamaam Abraham, chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. Hin xi k'amwik cho rub'eeh noq xik'ik cho chupaam chu'nchel i ruyuq'ul i Canaán. Eh xnuyeew i peet rak'uun Isaac, eh xnuk'ihaxb'isaj wo' taqe i riih rumaam. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xnuyeew wo' hoq kiib' i rak'uun, Isaac, i Jacob, eh re' i Esaú. Eh re' i Esaú xnuyeew reh i rax chee Seir. Eh re' taqe i rak'uun i Jacob xiooj ar Egipto. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh koq'uun chik xnutaq'aaj i Moisés ruch'ihil i Aarón. Re' hin xnuyeew i ma' k'isa ti' k'axik chikinaah i aj Egipto korehtaal xwesaj taqe cho ar. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xi elik cho Egipto taq aamaam awati't xitahqaljik cho kuum i aj Egipto ruuk' kareta reh i kikantesjiik, ruuk' kawayu reh q'aq'inik korehtaal xi k'uloq chi chii' i kaq palaw. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taq aamaam awati't xkik'er kichii' chupahqaljiik chi naa nutoob'eem taqe, eh re' hin xnukoj jinaj i q'equm q'atb'al pankiyejaal kuuk' i aj Egipto. Eh re' hin xnutz'ap kinaah i aj Egipto pan palaw. Re' taq i hat xawil taq ruuk' naq'awach taqe i ma' ilooj taj xnub'an cho Egipto. Eh chi riij i re' najt taq xat b'ehik chee hat chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Chi riij i re' korehtaal xat nuk'am taqe chaloq pan kiye'aab' i aj amorreo wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij ree i nim ha' Jordán. Re' keh xkitoq'aa' taq q'aq'inik awuuk', xa re' la' re' i hin xnuq'asaj taq panaq'ab'. Re' taq i hat xa a'n taq keh, eh xawehchaaj taq i kiye'aab'. <verse number="9" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' i kiye'aab' i aj Moab, re' Balac rak'uun i Zipor xchalik chi q'aq'inik taq awuuk' i hat. Eh re' i Balac xutaq'aaj rusik'ariik i Balaam, rak'uun i Beor, reh naq chi naa rupahqaam i ma' holohik taj taq cha naah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin ma' xnuyeew ta q'ab' reh i Balaam chi xupahqaaj i ma' holohik taj taq cha naah, re' la' chik i holohik xupahqaaj taq cha naah. Je' aj re' noq xat nuko'leej taq i hat. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat xaq'at taq cho wach i nim ha' Jordán, xat k'ulik taq Jericó. Eh re' i wilkeeb' chi patinik Jericó re' taqe i aj amorreo, taqe aj ferezeo, taqe aj cananeo, taqe i aj heteo, taqe aj gergeseo, taqe i aj heveo, taqe i aj jebuseo, xkitoq'aa' q'aq'inik taq awuuk' i hat, xa re' la' re' hin xinq'asanik taq panaq'ab' chi xa a'n taq keh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kiib' chi kireey i aj amorreo, ma' re' ta taq i hat xat b'anik keh ruuk' taq aaflecha, ruuk' taq aq'as laj ch'ihch', xnutaq'aaj la' chaloq chi peet chawach taq i hat i xyohb'isanik keh, reh chi kimolom chik chi elik noq xat k'ulik taq iloq i hat. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin xnuyeew taq aweh i ye'aab' ma' hat ta taq xat qasanik wach, nuyeew taq aweh i tinamit ma' hat ta taq xa yej-aniik reh. Re' taq i hat patim wii' yu'naak, eh inak'ux taq i uuva, inak'ux taq i olivo, ma' hat ta taq xatikwik reh, inki Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' Josué je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or keh i aj Israel: Yu'naak chayohleej taq wach i QaJaaw Dios, eh cha nimaj taq chu'nchel ak'ux, chu'nchel awánima. Eh maaloq'ej taq chik aweh taqe i tiyoox ixkiloq'ej taq aamaam awati't chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, noq wilkeeb' cho Egipto xa re' taq i QaJaaw Dios naa taq animam. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh wila' ma' nawaaj taq animam i QaJaaw Dios, cha sik' taq wach yu'naak awach taq i naa animam, re' oon wo' taqe i tiyoox xkiloq'ej taq chaloq aamaam awati't chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, oon re' i tiyoox inkinimaj i aj amorreo wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' wili. Xa re' la' re' hin wuch'ihil taqe awach weh panupaat re' i QaJaaw Dios naaqanimam inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' i tinamit Israel je' wili i xkiq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Ma' ta naq nee ruyeew q'ab' i QaJaaw Dios chi neenqakanaa' rulooq'jiik i reh ruum i kiloq'ojiik taqe i tiyoox. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ruum xa re' wo' hoq i QaJaaw i qaDios, x-esanik cho keh Egipto i qamaam qati't, je' wo' hoq i hoj, re' naq i hoj i minooj wii' pankowlaj kamanik. Eh re' wo' qaDios xb'anik i ma' k'isiin i ma' ilooj taj chi qawach. Re' wo' reh xko'linik qeh noq xoj ik'ik cho chupaam taqe i ye'aab', eh noq xoj ik'ik cho chupaam i ma' k'isa tinamit. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' wo' i QaJaaw Dios x-esanik panqab'eeh taqe i tinamit aj ixowaal. Eh re' wo' reh x-esanik taqe reje i aj amorreo wilkeeb' naq ayu'. Ruum chu'nchel i xub'an cho quuk' re' re' i QaJaaw Dios xa re' wo' reh naaqanimam, ruum xa re' wo' reh i qaDios, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh i tinamit Israel:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' taq i hat ma' nee ta taq i na a'n runimjiik i QaJaaw Dios ruum re' reh wilik rusantohiil, eh iraaj chi xa re' wo' reh nee taq inanimaj. Eh ma' nee ta rukuy taq amahk wi ma' xanimaj taq, eh wi xat mahkunik taq chuwach. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh wila' xaq'eb' taq chi riij ak'ux i runimjiik, wi xat'ooj taq chi kilooq'jiik i xatz'aqoj tiyoox. Re' QaJaaw naa ruye'em chaloq i ti' k'axik taq cha naah naa taq rusacham awach, atoob' ta ma' k'isa otob'il i rub'anam taq cha weh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh re' tinamit je' wili ruchaq'weesjiik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj xa re' wo' QaJaaw Dios naaqanimam, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' Josué je' wili i xuq'or keh:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' taq i hat ruuk' taq aachii' xaq'or chi xa re' wo' reh taq naa animam, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Korik re' hoj xoj q'orik reh, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Je' wo' chik wili i xq'orarik keh ruum i Josué: Wila' je' re' chawesaj taq chu'nchel i tiyoox wilik taq chaxilak cha nimaj taq chu'nchel ak'ux QaJaaw Dios taq i hat, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' tinamit je' wili chaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj xa re' chik i QaJaaw Dios naaqanimam eh naaqanam chu'nchel aha' wilik i naa ruq'orom qeh, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh xa chupaam wo' q'iij re' re' ar Siquem, re' Josué wilik i xuyejaa' wach kuuk' i tinamit wilik i k'uhb'aal xuq'or keh, eh xuq'or keh i naa kianam. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh re' Josué xutz'ihb'aaj rehtalil chupaam i huuj tz'ihb'amaj wii' i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Dios. Eh chi riij i re' xuchop chaloq jinaj i nimlaj ab'aj xutik chi ri'sil jinaj i chee tz'inuj wilik chucheel i rusantolaj ye'aab' i Dios. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh je' wili xuq'or keh chu'nchel i tinamit Israel:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' ab'aj wili naa rukamaniik qeh chi rehtalil chi xak'ulaa' taq chi naa a'nam chu'nchel i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios. Eh noq naa taq awilom wach ab'aj wili naa ruk'uliik taq cho panak'ux i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios, eh rehtalil chi ma' ruk'ul taj chi nee taq i nachuk i q'orik reh i QaJaaw Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh chi riij i re', re' Josué xutaq'aaj taqe reje i aj Israel chupaam i kitinamiit chi kiju'junaal.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i rukimiik i Josué</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JDG 2:6-10">Jue 2.6-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh noq xakomajaa' wo' najtir imb'aan taqe re' xkimik i Josué raj kamanoom i Dios rak'uun i Nun, eh jinaj siento ruuk' lajeeb' haab' i wilik reh noq xkimik. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh ar xkimuq'aa' chupaam i rutinamiit Timnat-sera, xye'arik reh, wilik chinaah i yuuq' re' ruuk' i kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam Efraín wilik pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i yuuq' Gaas. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkinimaj i QaJaaw Dios noq kok'achlik i Josué. Eh je' wo' hoq noq kamnaq chik, noq kok'achalkeeb' taqe i mama' winaq xinab'inik reh aha' wilik i holohik chi b'anarik xub'an i Dios kuuk' i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe aj Israel xkimuq'aa' irub'aqil i José ar Siquem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel xkik'am chaloq irub'aqil i José ar Egipto, eh ar xk'ulik kimuq'aa' chupaam i ye'aab' Siquem, chupaam i ye'aab' xiloq' i rajaaw i José re' i Jacob chi jinaj siento chi tumiin re' ruuk' i plata. Re' i xiloq' kuuk' i riih rumaam i Hamor, re' i rajaaw Siquem. Chi riij i re' xkahnik chi kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i José.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' rukimiik i Eleazar k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' i Eleazar i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij rak'uun i Aarón xkimik wo' reje, ar xkimuq'aa' chinaah i k'isayuuq', ruye'aab' i Jinees i rak'uun, re' i xye'arik reh chinaah i yuuq' pan kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam Efraín.</para>
</usx>